WEBVTT

00:00:17.780 --> 00:00:19.740
On our vast planet...

00:00:20.450 --> 00:00:24.250
there are thousands, millions of people.

00:00:24.920 --> 00:00:30.750
And there are many meetings
and partings between them.

00:00:32.760 --> 00:00:37.850
This is the story of one of those little
encounters and the events that followed.

00:00:39.850 --> 00:00:43.060
We met in the spring of my
third year in elementary school.

00:00:43.060 --> 00:00:46.690
This is our small, yet precious,

00:00:46.690 --> 00:00:50.270
story of how we found each other.

00:01:33.840 --> 00:01:36.700
You don't belong here!

00:01:39.070 --> 00:01:41.950
Return to where you belong!

00:01:47.670 --> 00:01:50.380
Melodious rhythm, become light!

00:01:50.380 --> 00:01:53.130
Bind the forbidden monster
within this sealing circle!

00:01:53.130 --> 00:01:55.130
Preparing to seal.

00:02:04.560 --> 00:02:06.140
Jewel Seed, seal!

00:02:45.560 --> 00:02:48.230
I need to... chase after it...

00:03:17.210 --> 00:03:20.000
That was a pretty weird dream...

00:03:27.100 --> 00:03:31.760
I'm Takamachi Nanoha,
the youngest in a family of five,

00:03:31.760 --> 00:03:34.400
and I'm a perfectly average third-grader.

00:03:36.150 --> 00:03:38.440
Good morning!

00:03:38.440 --> 00:03:39.280
Nanoha-chan!

00:03:40.150 --> 00:03:42.660
Nanoha, over here! Over here!

00:03:42.660 --> 00:03:45.580
Suzuka-chan, Arisa-chan, good morning.

00:03:45.580 --> 00:03:46.450
Good morning.

00:03:46.450 --> 00:03:48.250
Good morning, Nanoha-chan.

00:03:53.250 --> 00:03:56.670
Even these kinds of jobs are very important.

00:03:56.670 --> 00:03:58.920
They help everyone live their lives in peace.

00:04:00.130 --> 00:04:03.180
As you can see, there are all sorts of jobs.

00:04:03.720 --> 00:04:07.180
What do you want to be in the future?

00:04:07.180 --> 00:04:09.930
You should all start thinking about that.

00:04:10.600 --> 00:04:12.560
<i>My future...</i>

00:04:12.560 --> 00:04:13.940
<i>What I want to do...</i>

00:04:16.440 --> 00:04:19.440
<i>I'm not sure if I even have any dreams for the future.</i>

00:04:20.570 --> 00:04:22.240
<i>That's what my life is like.</i>

00:04:32.720 --> 00:04:35.370
It's not safe, you should stay away.

00:04:35.370 --> 00:04:37.000
Oh... okay.

00:04:38.040 --> 00:04:38.960
<i>Isn't this...?</i>

00:04:42.010 --> 00:04:44.430
Um, what happened?

00:04:44.430 --> 00:04:48.010
The park and the boats were all destroyed.
We're cleaning it up now.

00:04:48.010 --> 00:04:50.060
I see.

00:04:50.060 --> 00:04:52.770
This is a bit much for a prank.

00:04:53.250 --> 00:04:55.770
We had the police come and take a look.

00:04:55.770 --> 00:04:58.770
<i>Is this the place I saw in my dream last night?</i>

00:04:59.360 --> 00:05:00.110
<i>Help me...</i>

00:05:02.530 --> 00:05:04.150
Nanoha-chan?

00:05:04.150 --> 00:05:06.490
Suzuka-chan, did you just hear something?

00:05:06.490 --> 00:05:07.240
Hear something...

00:05:07.780 --> 00:05:09.490
Sorry, hold on a second!

00:05:57.790 --> 00:06:02.130
His wound isn't all that deep,
but he certainly looks pretty weak.

00:06:02.670 --> 00:06:05.170
Doctor, thank you very much!

00:06:05.170 --> 00:06:06.420
Thank you!

00:06:06.420 --> 00:06:07.840
Don't mention it.

00:06:07.840 --> 00:06:11.930
He's a ferret, right?
I wonder if he's someone's pet...

00:06:11.930 --> 00:06:15.720
If he is a ferret, he'd certainly
be a strange breed.

00:06:23.690 --> 00:06:27.280
Anyway, you should let him rest for a while.

00:06:27.280 --> 00:06:29.490
So, I'll hold onto him for tonight, okay?

00:06:29.490 --> 00:06:30.820
Okay!

00:06:32.070 --> 00:06:33.490
Please take good care of him.

00:06:39.250 --> 00:06:41.750
And... send!

00:06:51.050 --> 00:06:52.430
<i>Can you hear me?</i>

00:06:52.930 --> 00:06:55.180
<i>Can you hear my voice?</i>

00:06:55.180 --> 00:06:57.100
<i>This voice is...</i>

00:06:57.100 --> 00:06:58.180
<i>Please listen...</i>

00:07:00.440 --> 00:07:03.440
<i>I have a request for anyone
who can hear my voice...</i>

00:07:04.070 --> 00:07:05.440
<i>Please help me.</i>

00:07:06.070 --> 00:07:07.190
<i>Please...</i>

00:07:21.680 --> 00:07:22.920
It's that sound again...!

00:08:07.250 --> 00:08:09.050
What... What's going on?!

00:08:11.590 --> 00:08:13.220
You came for me.

00:08:15.680 --> 00:08:19.560
Uh, what's going on?! What's happening?!

00:08:19.560 --> 00:08:21.680
Um, I need to ask something of you.

00:08:21.680 --> 00:08:23.940
Could you help me out for a bit?

00:08:32.650 --> 00:08:35.160
I'll pay you back!

00:08:35.160 --> 00:08:37.410
This is no time to talk
about repaying me, is it?

00:08:39.240 --> 00:08:42.540
With my current mana reserves,
I can't stop that thing.

00:08:43.080 --> 00:08:44.540
But you can!

00:08:44.540 --> 00:08:46.170
Mana?

00:08:50.590 --> 00:08:51.670
What do I have to do?

00:08:51.670 --> 00:08:53.130
Take this.

00:08:59.640 --> 00:09:02.770
Hold it in your hands,
close your eyes, and clear your mind.

00:09:11.320 --> 00:09:15.320
New user registration, full open.

00:09:19.530 --> 00:09:21.160
Repeat after me:

00:09:21.160 --> 00:09:23.860
Wind in the sky...
Stars in the heavens...

00:09:24.370 --> 00:09:27.670
Wind in the sky...
Stars in the heavens...

00:09:28.100 --> 00:09:30.230
And an unbreakable spirit within my heart...

00:09:30.580 --> 00:09:33.170
And an unbreakable spirit within my heart...

00:09:39.390 --> 00:09:40.680
Bring forth your magic to my hands!

00:09:41.180 --> 00:09:42.520
Bring forth your magic to my hands!

00:09:46.020 --> 00:09:50.110
Raising Heart, Set up!

00:09:50.110 --> 00:09:52.610
Stand by, Ready. Set up.

00:09:59.820 --> 00:10:02.330
Such incredible mana...

00:10:06.330 --> 00:10:08.120
Welcome, New User.

00:10:08.290 --> 00:10:11.290
Um, nice to meet you.

00:10:11.380 --> 00:10:14.550
Your magic level qualifies you to use me.

00:10:14.960 --> 00:10:17.930
May I select the optimum configuration

00:10:17.930 --> 00:10:20.430
for the Barrier Jacket and the Device?

00:10:20.890 --> 00:10:23.680
Um, okay, I guess!

00:10:23.680 --> 00:10:24.680
All right.

00:10:29.310 --> 00:10:31.060
Stand by, Ready.

00:11:08.770 --> 00:11:10.770
Barrier Jacket, Set up.

00:11:50.980 --> 00:11:51.940
It worked!

00:12:11.370 --> 00:12:13.870
How much do you know about magic?

00:12:14.130 --> 00:12:15.880
Nothing! Nothing at all!

00:12:16.130 --> 00:12:18.500
Then I shall teach you everything.

00:12:18.500 --> 00:12:20.010
Please do as I say.

00:12:20.210 --> 00:12:21.380
R... Right!

00:12:23.380 --> 00:12:24.470
Flier Fin.

00:12:36.690 --> 00:12:39.150
What is that thing? Is it alive?

00:12:39.400 --> 00:12:42.450
No, it is not a living being.

00:12:42.450 --> 00:12:45.030
It is an entity from Lost Logia.

00:12:47.370 --> 00:12:48.330
Protection!

00:12:54.670 --> 00:12:57.170
Your magical powers are impressive.

00:12:57.880 --> 00:13:00.380
Incredible. She's even better than I expected.

00:13:01.670 --> 00:13:04.630
With that much mana,
we'll definitely be able to stop it!

00:13:05.220 --> 00:13:07.640
She can seal it with Raising Heart!

00:13:09.760 --> 00:13:12.230
To seal either get closer,

00:13:12.230 --> 00:13:14.390
and invoke the Sealing Magic,

00:13:14.390 --> 00:13:16.770
or use more powerful magic.

00:13:18.690 --> 00:13:19.480
Um...

00:13:19.820 --> 00:13:22.360
Imagine you're about to strike.

00:13:22.490 --> 00:13:24.820
I can't just do that all of a sudden!

00:13:51.850 --> 00:13:53.770
Hold out your strongest hand.

00:13:53.770 --> 00:13:55.770
O-Okay!

00:13:58.020 --> 00:13:59.360
Shoot The Bullet!

00:14:03.110 --> 00:14:03.940
Shoot!

00:14:16.540 --> 00:14:17.830
It's getting away!

00:14:25.970 --> 00:14:27.090
I can't catch up!

00:14:27.090 --> 00:14:29.430
If it gets to a place with lots of people...

00:14:32.050 --> 00:14:34.520
That light from before,
can you shoot it at long range?

00:14:34.720 --> 00:14:36.520
If that's what you desire.

00:14:49.320 --> 00:14:50.780
That's right.

00:14:50.780 --> 00:14:55.040
Focus your internal spiritual heat, through your arms.

00:14:57.500 --> 00:14:59.830
Mode Change: Cannon Mode.

00:15:10.010 --> 00:15:12.260
She's using a sealing cannon!?

00:15:13.350 --> 00:15:16.270
She's a bombardment type?

00:15:18.640 --> 00:15:20.640
Shoot in Buster Mode.

00:15:23.310 --> 00:15:26.020
Immediate fire when target is locked.

00:15:49.720 --> 00:15:51.510
Nice shot!

00:15:55.390 --> 00:15:58.970
She sealed them... in one shot...

00:16:04.270 --> 00:16:05.770
These are Jewel Seeds.

00:16:07.070 --> 00:16:08.280
Touch them with Raising Heart.

00:16:09.570 --> 00:16:10.320
Like this?

00:16:13.820 --> 00:16:17.830
Internalize No. XVIII, XX, XXI.

00:16:40.930 --> 00:16:42.080
Are you okay?

00:16:42.080 --> 00:16:45.310
I'm fine... I think.

00:16:51.530 --> 00:16:54.200
I don't know if you'll believe me,

00:16:54.200 --> 00:16:58.580
but I'm not from here.
I come from another world.

00:17:07.840 --> 00:17:11.050
You were just using magic.

00:17:11.050 --> 00:17:13.550
It's a form of technology from my world.

00:17:14.010 --> 00:17:19.050
What you just fought were dangerous
ancient relics from my world,

00:17:19.060 --> 00:17:21.810
the Lost Logia known as Jewel Seeds.

00:17:21.810 --> 00:17:23.810
Jewel Seeds...

00:17:24.480 --> 00:17:29.070
They've been known to run rampant at the slightest provocation, as you just saw.

00:17:29.070 --> 00:17:32.200
They're highly dangerous energy crystals.

00:17:32.720 --> 00:17:34.220
No way...

00:17:34.220 --> 00:17:37.660
Why... Why was something like
that in our neighborhood?

00:17:39.950 --> 00:17:43.140
I'm afraid... it's my fault.

00:17:44.470 --> 00:17:48.580
I was working at an archaeological
dig back on my homeworld,

00:17:48.580 --> 00:17:52.340
and found them in some old ruins.

00:17:53.120 --> 00:17:56.590
I had contacted the Administrative
Bureau to take them for safekeeping.

00:17:58.010 --> 00:18:00.850
But it would seem the dimensional ship I had arranged to transport them...

00:18:00.850 --> 00:18:03.020
had an accident on the way.

00:18:09.860 --> 00:18:13.650
Twenty-one Jewel Seeds were
scattered across this world.

00:18:14.360 --> 00:18:18.160
I've only been able to retrieve the three that you helped me out with.

00:18:18.160 --> 00:18:21.530
I'm sorry, I haven't introduced myself.

00:18:21.530 --> 00:18:24.660
My name is Nanoha. Takamachi Nanoha.

00:18:24.660 --> 00:18:28.250
Oh, I'm Yuuno. Yuuno Scrya.

00:18:28.960 --> 00:18:30.250
Yuuno-kun, then.

00:18:45.310 --> 00:18:49.810
Unadministered World #97. Local name: Earth.

00:18:50.480 --> 00:18:54.150
The things that Mother is searching for,
the Jewel Seeds. They're here.

00:18:54.560 --> 00:18:56.400
Yes, sir.

00:19:02.830 --> 00:19:05.160
<i>Raising Heart, can you hear me?</i>

00:19:05.240 --> 00:19:07.290
<i>Yes, I can hear you.</i>

00:19:07.960 --> 00:19:09.710
<i>All that flashy stuff yesterday,</i>

00:19:09.710 --> 00:19:12.750
<i>was that all you?</i>

00:19:12.750 --> 00:19:14.500
<i>Yes, mostly.</i>

00:19:14.630 --> 00:19:17.010
<i>I guess you're pretty high-tech, then.</i>

00:19:17.010 --> 00:19:18.970
<i>But unfortunately,</i>

00:19:18.970 --> 00:19:20.930
<i>I can do little on my own.</i>

00:19:21.140 --> 00:19:23.930
<i>In a sense, I'm merely a vehicle.</i>

00:19:24.140 --> 00:19:25.680
<i>Without a driver,</i>

00:19:25.680 --> 00:19:28.600
<i>I cannot fully display my capabilities.</i>

00:19:28.640 --> 00:19:33.650
<i>I have the potential to be that driver for you.</i>

00:19:33.900 --> 00:19:35.980
<i>If that is what you desire...</i>

00:19:35.980 --> 00:19:38.320
<i>and you are willing to put in the work.</i>

00:19:47.410 --> 00:19:50.460
Anyway, me and Suzuka have practice today.

00:19:50.460 --> 00:19:51.390
See you later.

00:19:51.390 --> 00:19:53.170
Right. Good luck at practice!

00:20:22.990 --> 00:20:25.240
<i>Yuuno-kun, can you hear me?</i>

00:20:25.740 --> 00:20:27.490
<i>Yeah, Nanoha.</i>

00:20:27.490 --> 00:20:31.500
<i>About the Jewel Seeds you
were talking about yesterday...</i>

00:20:35.460 --> 00:20:36.380
This signature is...

00:20:53.190 --> 00:20:54.150
Bardiche!

00:20:54.690 --> 00:20:55.480
Get set.

00:21:02.650 --> 00:21:04.570
Barrier Jacket, Set up!

00:21:19.460 --> 00:21:20.500
Axe Form.

00:21:58.330 --> 00:22:00.340
<i>Nanoha! Nanoha!</i>

00:22:00.340 --> 00:22:03.340
<i>Stop! Wait until I get there!</i>

00:22:03.340 --> 00:22:04.630
<i>I can't!</i>

00:22:04.630 --> 00:22:07.340
<i>People and animals
might get caught up in it!</i>

00:22:08.010 --> 00:22:09.930
<i>I did just fine last night.</i>

00:22:09.930 --> 00:22:11.680
<i>I have Raising Heart with me again,</i>

00:22:11.680 --> 00:22:13.470
<i>so I'm sure that I'll be fine!</i>

00:22:20.270 --> 00:22:21.610
Raising Heart,

00:22:21.610 --> 00:22:24.400
I'm going to work hard and practice!

00:22:25.490 --> 00:22:27.780
So tell me! What do I need to do?

00:22:27.820 --> 00:22:30.160
I will do everything in my power.

00:22:30.280 --> 00:22:32.290
Stand by, Ready.

00:22:32.290 --> 00:22:35.960
Raising Heart, Set up!

00:23:12.990 --> 00:23:15.500
Jewel Seed, seal!

00:23:15.500 --> 00:23:17.120
Sealing.

00:23:21.130 --> 00:23:22.460
Scythe Form!

00:23:25.710 --> 00:23:27.210
Jewel Seed, seal!

00:23:42.810 --> 00:23:45.320
Um... Wait!

00:23:52.660 --> 00:23:53.740
Um...

00:23:54.410 --> 00:23:57.620
Are you... looking for the Jewel Seeds, too?

00:23:58.290 --> 00:23:59.710
Don't come any closer.

00:23:59.710 --> 00:24:01.710
No, I...

00:24:02.630 --> 00:24:04.840
I just want to talk to you.

00:24:04.840 --> 00:24:07.710
Are you a mage, too?

00:24:07.710 --> 00:24:10.130
Why are you collecting the Jewel Seeds?

00:24:11.800 --> 00:24:12.680
Fire!

00:24:16.890 --> 00:24:17.720
Scythe Slash!

00:24:26.610 --> 00:24:30.900
Wait! I don't want to fight you!

00:24:30.900 --> 00:24:34.910
Then stay clear of me and the Jewel Seeds.

00:24:34.910 --> 00:24:38.160
But I need to find the Jewel Seeds for Yuuno-kun...

00:24:45.540 --> 00:24:46.800
Arc Saber!

00:24:50.300 --> 00:24:51.630
Protection!

00:24:53.630 --> 00:24:55.640
Saber Explode!

00:25:04.940 --> 00:25:06.120
I'm sorry.

00:25:29.420 --> 00:25:31.670
Internalize No. XVI.

00:25:32.920 --> 00:25:35.720
I might not be able to hold back next time.

00:25:37.720 --> 00:25:40.470
Give up on the Jewel Seeds.

00:25:47.060 --> 00:25:47.930
Nanoha!

00:25:47.930 --> 00:25:49.230
Yuuno-kun.

00:26:00.370 --> 00:26:02.120
Nanoha...

00:26:02.700 --> 00:26:04.620
I'm sorry. Are you all right?

00:26:04.620 --> 00:26:07.370
Thank you, Yuuno-kun.

00:26:07.830 --> 00:26:10.500
I'm fine...

00:26:18.470 --> 00:26:22.220
Wide-area search, Block 4 is... done!

00:26:23.930 --> 00:26:25.890
Arf, keep up the good work.

00:26:26.900 --> 00:26:27.900
Fate!

00:26:28.610 --> 00:26:31.400
Sorry to keep you working so late.
How are things on your end?

00:26:31.820 --> 00:26:34.680
I found an unactivated one a while ago.

00:26:35.340 --> 00:26:38.910
I think I can finish searching
this entire area tonight.

00:26:39.410 --> 00:26:40.750
Thanks.

00:26:40.750 --> 00:26:43.540
I only have the one that I sealed this evening.

00:26:43.540 --> 00:26:44.660
I see...

00:26:45.120 --> 00:26:49.150
Anyway, do you think the two you ran into...

00:26:49.150 --> 00:26:51.680
are from the Administrative Bureau?

00:26:51.680 --> 00:26:55.170
We shouldn't have anyone on our tail.

00:26:55.760 --> 00:26:57.480
I don't think so, either.

00:26:57.480 --> 00:27:00.100
For one thing, she couldn't use magic properly.

00:27:00.100 --> 00:27:01.180
I see.

00:27:01.180 --> 00:27:06.440
Well if it comes down to it,
all I have to do is beat the crap out of them!

00:27:06.440 --> 00:27:08.690
Don't worry about a thing, Fate!

00:27:08.690 --> 00:27:11.170
Thanks, Arf.

00:27:16.280 --> 00:27:19.030
Nanoha, are you sure this is okay?

00:27:19.030 --> 00:27:23.350
Of course it is. Actually, I should be asking
you to let me help find the Jewel Seeds.

00:27:23.350 --> 00:27:26.540
Raising Heart said she'd teach me about
collecting them and a lot of other things.

00:27:32.110 --> 00:27:34.170
So please, Yuuno-kun,

00:27:35.130 --> 00:27:38.680
can you teach me how to use magic properly?

00:27:48.880 --> 00:27:52.160
Mama, what's for lunch today?

00:27:52.650 --> 00:27:55.610
Hm, what should we have?

00:27:55.610 --> 00:27:58.350
I know, I know! Rice omelets!

00:27:58.350 --> 00:27:59.320
Again?

00:27:59.320 --> 00:28:01.710
Aw, but they taste so good! Right?

00:28:02.490 --> 00:28:05.120
I suppose they do. Oh, all right.

00:28:05.120 --> 00:28:06.120
Yay!

00:28:13.750 --> 00:28:15.300
Thanks for waiting!

00:28:15.300 --> 00:28:16.590
Mama!

00:28:19.300 --> 00:28:20.970
Are they filled with tons of jam?

00:28:21.510 --> 00:28:22.470
You bet.

00:28:22.470 --> 00:28:24.640
Yay! Mama, I love you!

00:28:43.240 --> 00:28:46.410
Inside the heart of every mage,
including both me and you,

00:28:46.990 --> 00:28:49.910
is a Linker Core,
an organ that generates mana.

00:28:52.370 --> 00:28:54.380
Imagine breathing in with your Linker Core,

00:28:54.380 --> 00:28:58.090
collecting and condensing the magic in the air.

00:29:01.760 --> 00:29:04.090
This is how you use magic.

00:29:10.220 --> 00:29:12.310
<i>Commencing image training.</i>

00:29:25.120 --> 00:29:28.530
Speed and power are essential in combat,

00:29:28.830 --> 00:29:31.080
but there are more important things.

00:29:31.240 --> 00:29:33.040
Do you know what it is?

00:29:34.830 --> 00:29:37.540
Um, the resolve to win?

00:29:37.540 --> 00:29:40.010
Good answer, but what else?

00:29:40.510 --> 00:29:41.750
Um...

00:29:41.750 --> 00:29:43.920
Wisdom and tactics.

00:29:47.300 --> 00:29:49.390
How to fly and shoot,

00:29:49.390 --> 00:29:52.470
and the theory and practice of aerial combat.

00:29:53.480 --> 00:29:55.600
I will teach you these things.

00:30:19.960 --> 00:30:22.630
Nanoha-chan, you can't
come over today, either?

00:30:22.630 --> 00:30:24.630
Yeah, sorry...

00:30:24.630 --> 00:30:27.680
It's fine. You've got something
important to do, right?

00:30:28.390 --> 00:30:29.550
I'm sorry...

00:30:31.720 --> 00:30:32.970
If you have to apologize,

00:30:32.970 --> 00:30:35.060
why don't you tell us what's going on?!

00:30:35.060 --> 00:30:36.690
Arisa-chan!

00:30:37.480 --> 00:30:38.520
I'm sorry.

00:30:39.060 --> 00:30:41.320
Fine. Let's go, Suzuka.

00:30:41.320 --> 00:30:45.070
Sorry, Nanoha-chan. See you tomorrow.

00:30:57.710 --> 00:31:00.460
<i>I think it's around here somewhere...</i>

00:31:02.460 --> 00:31:04.840
<i>Yeah, the signature is definitely...</i>

00:31:09.090 --> 00:31:11.510
...definitely coming from around here.

00:31:11.510 --> 00:31:14.520
But we can't pinpoint the exact location.

00:31:14.930 --> 00:31:16.520
This is a bit rough,

00:31:16.520 --> 00:31:19.520
but I'll force it to activate by
pouring mana into the area.

00:31:19.980 --> 00:31:21.020
Will you be okay?

00:31:21.900 --> 00:31:23.070
I'll be fine.

00:31:24.230 --> 00:31:25.780
Because I'm strong.

00:31:39.330 --> 00:31:42.380
They're forcing an activation
in the middle of the city?!

00:31:42.380 --> 00:31:43.880
Wide-area Barrier!

00:31:52.800 --> 00:31:53.390
Raising Heart!

00:31:56.180 --> 00:31:56.890
Please!

00:31:57.480 --> 00:31:58.940
Stand by, Ready.

00:32:10.070 --> 00:32:10.950
Found it.

00:32:10.950 --> 00:32:13.580
They see it too, Fate!

00:32:21.040 --> 00:32:23.330
Glaive Form, Get set!

00:32:23.330 --> 00:32:26.340
Nanoha, seal it before they can!

00:32:26.340 --> 00:32:27.340
Okay!

00:32:28.720 --> 00:32:29.550
Raising Heart!

00:32:30.500 --> 00:32:31.680
Cannon Mode.

00:32:42.520 --> 00:32:43.810
Divine Buster!

00:32:46.360 --> 00:32:48.190
Spark Smasher!

00:33:07.050 --> 00:33:08.260
Jewel Seed!

00:33:08.260 --> 00:33:09.760
Seal!

00:33:21.730 --> 00:33:23.400
Device Mode.

00:33:25.310 --> 00:33:28.320
<i>You did it! Nanoha, secure the Seed!</i>

00:33:28.320 --> 00:33:29.990
I'm not gonna let you!

00:33:36.620 --> 00:33:37.740
You're a...

00:33:38.540 --> 00:33:41.160
I'm not letting you get in Fate's way!

00:33:44.830 --> 00:33:47.250
I knew it.
You're her familiar!

00:33:59.180 --> 00:34:02.810
I didn't get a chance to introduce myself earlier.

00:34:03.480 --> 00:34:07.110
My name is Nanoha. Takamachi Nanoha.

00:34:07.110 --> 00:34:10.480
I'm a third-grader at
Seishou Private Elementary School.

00:34:11.740 --> 00:34:13.650
Scythe Form!

00:34:22.370 --> 00:34:25.870
I thought I told you to give up on the Jewel Seeds.

00:34:25.870 --> 00:34:27.790
Be that way,

00:34:27.790 --> 00:34:30.630
but you haven't answered my question, have you?

00:34:31.090 --> 00:34:32.840
You haven't told me your name, either!

00:34:58.950 --> 00:35:01.370
Why are you gathering the Jewel Seeds?!

00:35:01.370 --> 00:35:03.370
Those things are dangerous!

00:35:03.790 --> 00:35:05.000
You talk too much!

00:35:36.730 --> 00:35:38.950
Cannon Mode: Stun setting.

00:35:38.950 --> 00:35:40.950
Shoot!

00:35:48.290 --> 00:35:49.750
If you need them for some purpose,

00:35:50.250 --> 00:35:53.420
then it might be inevitable that we fight,

00:35:53.420 --> 00:35:55.010
and compete over them.

00:35:55.630 --> 00:35:59.510
But I don't want to fight someone without knowing what's going on!

00:36:00.390 --> 00:36:02.300
I'll tell you my side of the story, too.

00:36:02.300 --> 00:36:03.590
So tell me!

00:36:04.260 --> 00:36:07.390
Why do you need the Jewel Seeds?

00:36:09.310 --> 00:36:10.400
I'm just trying to...

00:36:10.400 --> 00:36:12.400
Fate, you don't have to answer her!

00:36:14.900 --> 00:36:17.320
Our job is to bring back the
Jewel Seeds, remember?

00:36:26.290 --> 00:36:27.510
Nanoha!

00:36:27.510 --> 00:36:28.580
I'm fine!

00:37:37.650 --> 00:37:40.530
I'm sorry. Return, Bardiche.

00:37:40.530 --> 00:37:41.900
Yes, sir.

00:37:58.630 --> 00:37:59.550
Fate!

00:38:04.470 --> 00:38:07.050
Fate, no! That's dangerous!

00:38:13.520 --> 00:38:17.060
Stop... Stop... Stop!

00:38:20.030 --> 00:38:22.900
Stop... Stop!

00:38:24.630 --> 00:38:25.570
Stop!

00:38:37.080 --> 00:38:38.920
Fate!

00:39:09.830 --> 00:39:13.330
Yuuno-kun, is Raising Heart okay?

00:39:13.330 --> 00:39:17.790
Yeah, her automatic regeneration system is running.

00:39:20.750 --> 00:39:24.550
I'm sorry, Raising Heart...

00:39:36.690 --> 00:39:39.190
I'm sorry, Fate. Bear with it for just a bit more.

00:39:39.980 --> 00:39:42.190
I'm fine. Thanks, Arf.

00:39:50.570 --> 00:39:51.430
<i>Nanoha?</i>

00:39:51.430 --> 00:39:53.200
<i>Yuuno-kun?</i>

00:39:53.910 --> 00:39:56.460
<i>What's got you up so early?</i>

00:39:56.460 --> 00:39:59.120
<i>Oh, I was just...</i>

00:40:00.500 --> 00:40:02.370
<i>Hey, Yuuno-kun...</i>

00:40:02.370 --> 00:40:03.290
<i>Hm?</i>

00:40:03.290 --> 00:40:06.970
<i>I'm... I'm worried about that other girl.</i>

00:40:07.470 --> 00:40:10.640
<i>Her name was Fate, right?</i>

00:40:11.140 --> 00:40:11.970
<i>Yeah.</i>

00:40:12.850 --> 00:40:16.980
<i>That girl's eyes seemed so lonely.</i>

00:40:17.840 --> 00:40:22.060
<i>And when she shot me,
she said she was sorry.</i>

00:40:23.610 --> 00:40:26.400
<i>I'm sure she has some reason.</i>

00:40:26.400 --> 00:40:30.110
<i>A reason why she's fighting.
And why she wants the Jewel Seeds.</i>

00:40:31.620 --> 00:40:34.990
<i>I want to talk to her.</i>

00:40:35.620 --> 00:40:38.370
<i>So to do that, I'll...</i>

00:40:41.880 --> 00:40:44.880
You're getting her sweets?

00:40:44.880 --> 00:40:48.630
I wonder if she'll even want them.

00:40:49.260 --> 00:40:52.590
I don't know, but it's
the thought that counts.

00:40:55.720 --> 00:40:58.980
Dimensional Shift. Destination:

00:40:58.980 --> 00:41:00.190
The Garden of Time.

00:41:20.080 --> 00:41:21.000
What's our status, everyone?

00:41:21.870 --> 00:41:23.250
Is everything going smoothly?

00:41:23.920 --> 00:41:26.460
Yes, ma'am. We're right on schedule.

00:41:27.300 --> 00:41:31.230
There hasn't been any overt activity since that last small-scale dimensional distortion.

00:41:33.800 --> 00:41:37.970
It looks like the two mages
who are our prime suspects

00:41:37.970 --> 00:41:40.430
haven't been active recently.

00:41:41.100 --> 00:41:43.940
Even if it was a small incident
on an unadministered world,

00:41:43.940 --> 00:41:45.810
we can't turn a blind eye to someone

00:41:45.810 --> 00:41:46.980
setting off a dimensional distortion.

00:41:46.980 --> 00:41:50.490
Right. Let's get this wrapped
up as quickly as possible.

00:41:56.530 --> 00:42:00.080
They definitely are Jewel Seeds...

00:42:00.790 --> 00:42:02.620
Yes, Mother.

00:42:02.620 --> 00:42:07.840
I'd love to compliment you on a job well done.

00:42:10.630 --> 00:42:14.050
But what did I tell you?

00:42:14.050 --> 00:42:15.890
U-Um...

00:42:16.890 --> 00:42:22.850
I told you to bring me all
twenty-one Jewel Seeds, did I not?

00:42:24.440 --> 00:42:28.070
I need them for my research,

00:42:28.820 --> 00:42:33.070
but you've only collected
three after all this time?

00:42:34.360 --> 00:42:35.860
What is that?

00:42:35.860 --> 00:42:37.950
Um, I got this for you...

00:42:42.160 --> 00:42:43.830
If you had enough time to get that,

00:42:43.830 --> 00:42:46.010
then you had time to do as you were told!

00:42:46.580 --> 00:42:47.580
I'm sorry!

00:42:48.920 --> 00:42:50.680
I'm disappointed, Fate.

00:42:51.380 --> 00:42:54.090
You leave me no choice but to punish you.

00:42:54.090 --> 00:42:55.590
Yes.

00:43:03.810 --> 00:43:06.350
Why?! Why is she doing this?

00:43:07.060 --> 00:43:11.020
She brought you what you asked for, didn't she?!

00:43:18.070 --> 00:43:20.030
I need those Jewel Seeds,

00:43:20.030 --> 00:43:23.700
to make my dream come true.

00:43:24.290 --> 00:43:25.040
Yes.

00:43:25.040 --> 00:43:28.880
Don't disappoint me.

00:43:28.880 --> 00:43:30.880
Yes, Mother...

00:43:40.470 --> 00:43:44.890
And so the changing shape of the Moon in the sky is the result

00:43:44.890 --> 00:43:47.020
of how light from the Sun hits it.

00:43:48.560 --> 00:43:52.520
The Sun illuminates it by...

00:44:00.780 --> 00:44:02.410
Bardiche, how are you?

00:44:02.410 --> 00:44:04.450
Recovery complete.

00:44:07.330 --> 00:44:10.380
You sense it, don't you? I do, too.

00:44:11.420 --> 00:44:14.050
Yeah, it's close by.

00:44:25.720 --> 00:44:26.810
Nanoha!

00:44:26.810 --> 00:44:27.760
Yuuno-kun!

00:44:28.600 --> 00:44:31.900
Raising Heart, you're doing better now, huh?

00:44:32.360 --> 00:44:33.900
Condition green.

00:44:34.610 --> 00:44:37.610
Wanna give it our all again?

00:44:37.610 --> 00:44:40.410
All right, my master.

00:45:20.990 --> 00:45:22.240
Get set.

00:45:29.960 --> 00:45:32.620
Um, Fate-chan...

00:45:35.500 --> 00:45:37.130
Fate Testarossa.

00:45:38.670 --> 00:45:42.130
I just want to talk to you.

00:45:43.010 --> 00:45:46.640
I won't let you have the Jewel Seeds, got it?

00:45:49.730 --> 00:45:51.140
Neither will I.

00:45:51.850 --> 00:45:54.190
I want to hear why you're doing this.

00:45:54.190 --> 00:45:57.860
Why are you collecting the Jewel Seeds?

00:45:58.440 --> 00:46:01.860
Why do you have such a
lonely look in your eyes?

00:46:05.530 --> 00:46:10.160
If I win, will you tell me?

00:46:24.720 --> 00:46:25.510
That's enough!

00:46:29.260 --> 00:46:33.600
I'm an Enforcer from the Time-Space Administrative Bureau, Chrono Harlaown.

00:46:35.100 --> 00:46:35.980
It's the Bureau!

00:46:36.480 --> 00:46:38.520
Now, then. Would someone mind explaining what's going on here?

00:46:46.910 --> 00:46:48.700
Fate! We're retreating.

00:47:03.470 --> 00:47:04.380
Fate?

00:47:11.600 --> 00:47:12.640
Fate!

00:47:15.310 --> 00:47:17.270
Fate! Fate!

00:47:24.280 --> 00:47:25.400
Don't!

00:47:26.320 --> 00:47:27.820
Don't shoot them!

00:47:41.460 --> 00:47:43.840
Enforcer Chrono, good work.

00:47:44.380 --> 00:47:47.640
I'm sorry, Captain.
I let one of the parties get away.

00:47:47.640 --> 00:47:50.350
Well, that's all right.

00:47:51.140 --> 00:47:53.470
I want to know exactly what's going on.

00:47:53.470 --> 00:47:56.100
Bring those two aboard the Arthra.

00:47:56.100 --> 00:47:56.720
Roger.

00:48:10.740 --> 00:48:13.450
<i>Yuuno-kun, where are we?</i>

00:48:13.900 --> 00:48:17.710
<i>Looks like a dimensional patrol ship from
the Time-Space Administrative Bureau.</i>

00:48:19.500 --> 00:48:22.920
Oh, you can release your Barrier Jacket.

00:48:22.920 --> 00:48:24.420
O-Okay.

00:48:31.550 --> 00:48:32.930
You too.

00:48:32.930 --> 00:48:36.060
That's not your true form, right?

00:48:36.060 --> 00:48:37.310
Oh yeah, I almost forgot.

00:48:48.150 --> 00:48:51.570
I guess it's been a while since
you've seen me like this.

00:48:55.410 --> 00:48:59.540
You're a normal boy?!

00:49:00.210 --> 00:49:00.790
Huh?

00:49:00.790 --> 00:49:01.580
What?

00:49:02.460 --> 00:49:04.370
Didn't you see me like this when we first met?

00:49:05.800 --> 00:49:10.010
<i>For now,</i> we have more
pressing matters to attend to.

00:49:10.010 --> 00:49:11.340
O-Oh, okay.

00:49:29.900 --> 00:49:30.620
Go on in.

00:49:30.620 --> 00:49:32.660
O-Okay!

00:49:32.660 --> 00:49:35.830
I see. So you were the one

00:49:35.830 --> 00:49:39.580
who uncovered those Lost Logia, the Jewel Seeds?

00:49:39.580 --> 00:49:41.250
Yes, ma'am.

00:49:41.250 --> 00:49:43.580
Excuse me, what are Lost Logia?

00:49:43.580 --> 00:49:47.340
I suppose it wouldn't make sense...

00:49:47.340 --> 00:49:49.300
if I called them remnants of a lost world, would it?

00:49:51.470 --> 00:49:54.930
Countless worlds exist within dimensional space.

00:49:54.930 --> 00:49:56.180
You know that much, right?

00:49:57.060 --> 00:50:02.440
Some of those worlds develop too
far in ways that aren't very good.

00:50:02.440 --> 00:50:05.020
Their technology and science
advance too far for their own good,

00:50:05.020 --> 00:50:07.480
eventually destroying their own world...

00:50:09.820 --> 00:50:14.110
and leaving behind dangerous relics.

00:50:14.110 --> 00:50:18.120
We use the general term "Lost Logia" for them.

00:50:18.120 --> 00:50:21.910
Indeed, these are items that
we of the Administrative Bureau,

00:50:21.910 --> 00:50:25.080
as a protective organization,
must strictly oversee.

00:50:25.080 --> 00:50:28.590
And you and your friend here
are looking for said Jewel Seeds.

00:50:31.840 --> 00:50:35.680
They're crystallized forms of energy
used for dimensional interference.

00:50:35.680 --> 00:50:37.850
They're a dangerous type known to use the magic they're infused with

00:50:37.850 --> 00:50:40.850
as a catalyst to trigger dimensional distortions.

00:50:42.020 --> 00:50:46.690
The tremor and flash of light when
you and that other girl fought each other,

00:50:46.690 --> 00:50:48.270
that was a dimensional distortion.

00:50:49.230 --> 00:50:53.110
You saw how much one
Jewel Seed had in terms of power.

00:50:53.780 --> 00:50:57.780
I can't even imagine what would happen if several went off at once.

00:50:57.780 --> 00:51:00.790
If there were a large-scale dimensional distortion, or even worse,

00:51:00.790 --> 00:51:02.410
a dimensional dislocation,

00:51:02.410 --> 00:51:05.790
it could easily eradicate a world or two.

00:51:06.460 --> 00:51:08.540
We must prevent that at all costs.

00:51:13.510 --> 00:51:16.590
For that reason, we are hereby taking charge

00:51:16.590 --> 00:51:18.050
of the Jewel Seeds' retrieval.

00:51:21.600 --> 00:51:24.060
You should forget about all this

00:51:24.060 --> 00:51:25.900
and go back to your own worlds.

00:51:25.900 --> 00:51:26.350
But...!

00:51:26.940 --> 00:51:30.360
Now, I don't expect this to sit well
with you coming out of the blue like this.

00:51:30.940 --> 00:51:33.570
So why don't you two talk things over tonight,

00:51:33.570 --> 00:51:37.570
and we'll talk about it again
tomorrow with fresh minds?

00:51:38.240 --> 00:51:41.080
Don't even think about it
if the Bureau's gotten involved!

00:51:41.080 --> 00:51:44.160
There's nothing we can do!

00:51:44.870 --> 00:51:46.790
It'll be okay.

00:51:46.790 --> 00:51:49.080
No, it won't be!

00:51:49.080 --> 00:51:51.630
They could find this place at any moment!

00:51:52.710 --> 00:51:54.300
That evil old witch.

00:51:54.300 --> 00:51:55.880
She's your mother,

00:51:55.880 --> 00:51:58.340
but she always treats you like garbage.

00:51:58.340 --> 00:52:01.140
Stop doing things for her!

00:52:02.350 --> 00:52:05.390
Don't speak badly of Mother...

00:52:05.390 --> 00:52:10.230
I will speak badly of her!
Because I'm so worried about you!

00:52:11.400 --> 00:52:14.570
You're my master, Fate,

00:52:14.570 --> 00:52:19.450
and you're the most important
girl in the whole world to me.

00:52:20.070 --> 00:52:23.200
You took me in when I was abandoned by my pack.

00:52:24.290 --> 00:52:26.580
You made me your familiar.

00:52:26.580 --> 00:52:29.210
You were always nice to me.

00:52:29.710 --> 00:52:34.710
I don't like it when you cry or are in pain!

00:52:36.470 --> 00:52:38.420
I'm sorry, Arf...

00:52:39.890 --> 00:52:41.640
Everything you say may be true,

00:52:43.140 --> 00:52:47.140
but I still want to make Mother's dream come true.

00:52:49.650 --> 00:52:55.040
And that's why Nanoha
and I would like to assist you.

00:52:55.040 --> 00:52:57.070
Assist us...

00:52:57.070 --> 00:53:03.160
Me aside, I believe Nanoha's magical ability
would significantly add to your forces.

00:53:03.160 --> 00:53:06.660
We should be pretty useful
in retrieving the Jewel Seeds,

00:53:06.660 --> 00:53:09.330
as well as in countering those girls.

00:53:09.330 --> 00:53:12.380
You've thought this through.

00:53:12.380 --> 00:53:13.790
Sure, why not?

00:53:13.790 --> 00:53:15.840
M-Mom– I mean, Captain!

00:53:16.420 --> 00:53:18.220
We'll let you help.

00:53:18.220 --> 00:53:20.840
It always pays to have an ace up your sleeve.

00:53:20.840 --> 00:53:22.970
Don't you agree, Enforcer Chrono?

00:53:22.970 --> 00:53:24.640
Y-Yes, ma'am.

00:53:35.020 --> 00:53:35.810
I got it!

00:53:35.810 --> 00:53:36.980
Nanoha!

00:53:39.780 --> 00:53:41.320
Restrict Lock.

00:53:43.950 --> 00:53:46.830
Good. If you use a bind correctly,

00:53:46.830 --> 00:53:48.700
you can stop a quick opponent

00:53:48.700 --> 00:53:51.120
and hit them with more powerful magic.

00:53:52.830 --> 00:53:57.460
Those two are pretty good.

00:54:05.680 --> 00:54:09.680
This is hopeless. I can't find them at all.

00:54:09.680 --> 00:54:11.600
They're pretty good, too.

00:54:12.140 --> 00:54:14.110
Since they escaped,

00:54:14.110 --> 00:54:17.100
they've been able to take two
Jewel Seeds that we located.

00:54:17.980 --> 00:54:19.360
They're pretty tough.

00:54:23.410 --> 00:54:25.700
No luck here, either, huh?

00:54:25.700 --> 00:54:26.450
Looks that way.

00:54:27.160 --> 00:54:30.200
Still, we are collecting them.

00:54:30.640 --> 00:54:34.710
And so, ten days passed since we first came aboard the Arthra to help.

00:54:35.710 --> 00:54:38.550
We've retrieved four of the Jewel Seeds,

00:54:39.840 --> 00:54:45.260
and Fate-chan is estimated
to have gotten three of them.

00:54:47.760 --> 00:54:51.020
We're having a hard time finding
the remaining seven, it seems.

00:54:51.020 --> 00:54:54.270
We're in the process of extending our search zones beyond just landmasses.

00:54:57.270 --> 00:54:58.770
Emergency!

00:54:58.770 --> 00:55:01.990
We're detecting a large-scale magical signature coming from an oceanic area within our search vector!

00:55:12.620 --> 00:55:16.380
<i>The Jewel Seeds are probably
in the ocean around here.</i>

00:55:16.920 --> 00:55:19.170
<i>I can't detect the exact location,</i>

00:55:19.170 --> 00:55:21.090
<i>so I'm going to pour mana into the sea,</i>

00:55:21.090 --> 00:55:23.420
<i>force them to activate, and collect them.</i>

00:55:28.350 --> 00:55:30.060
<i>But Fate...</i>

00:55:49.280 --> 00:55:53.240
I found them... the remaining seven.

00:55:56.420 --> 00:55:58.540
Let's go, Bardiche.

00:55:58.540 --> 00:55:59.710
Yes, sir!

00:56:05.930 --> 00:56:08.140
She's taking a pretty big risk.

00:56:08.140 --> 00:56:09.300
Fate-chan!

00:56:10.930 --> 00:56:13.640
Um, I need to go down there right away.

00:56:13.640 --> 00:56:14.850
That won't be necessary.

00:56:16.060 --> 00:56:18.600
If we leave her alone long enough,
she'll finish herself off.

00:56:19.610 --> 00:56:23.790
And if she doesn't, we'll hit her when she's used up all of her energy.

00:56:23.790 --> 00:56:24.860
Prepare to take her into custody!

00:56:24.860 --> 00:56:26.170
Roger that!

00:56:26.650 --> 00:56:27.660
But...!

00:56:34.650 --> 00:56:35.950
Scythe Form!

00:56:44.530 --> 00:56:46.460
Fate! Fate!

00:56:54.020 --> 00:56:57.390
This may seem cruel, but it is the best choice.

00:56:58.190 --> 00:56:59.350
But she'll...

00:57:00.100 --> 00:57:01.810
<i>Nanoha. Go.</i>

00:57:03.360 --> 00:57:07.280
<i>I'll open a gate, so you go save her.</i>

00:57:07.280 --> 00:57:09.160
<i>But, Yuuno-kun...</i>

00:57:10.140 --> 00:57:10.910
<i>Just go.</i>

00:57:15.870 --> 00:57:16.620
What are you–?

00:57:21.830 --> 00:57:25.250
I'm sorry, but I, Takamachi Nanoha,
am ignoring orders

00:57:25.760 --> 00:57:27.260
and acting on my own!

00:57:27.260 --> 00:57:31.010
I'm transferring you into that girl's barrier!

00:57:41.020 --> 00:57:43.350
Let's do this, Raising Heart!

00:57:43.350 --> 00:57:44.810
All right!

00:57:45.270 --> 00:57:46.310
Wind in the sky...

00:57:46.310 --> 00:57:47.820
Stars in the heavens...

00:57:47.820 --> 00:57:50.320
The bright, shining light within my arms...

00:57:50.320 --> 00:57:53.320
and an unbreakable spirit within my heart!

00:57:55.450 --> 00:57:58.990
Raising Heart, Set up!

00:58:02.040 --> 00:58:03.580
Stand by, Ready.

00:58:15.600 --> 00:58:17.590
Don't try to stop Fate!

00:58:20.800 --> 00:58:22.160
You have it all wrong!

00:58:22.160 --> 00:58:24.560
We didn't come here to fight you two!

00:58:24.560 --> 00:58:25.900
Yuuno-kun!

00:58:26.690 --> 00:58:29.400
I don't believe it!
What do you two think you're doing?

00:58:30.110 --> 00:58:31.360
I'm sorry!

00:58:31.360 --> 00:58:33.900
I'll apologize properly for disobeying orders later.

00:58:34.370 --> 00:58:36.410
But I can't stand by and do nothing!

00:58:38.410 --> 00:58:40.370
For now, we have to stop the Jewel Seeds!

00:58:41.960 --> 00:58:43.420
If we do nothing, they might fuse together,

00:58:43.420 --> 00:58:46.420
and become more powerful than we can handle!

00:58:47.410 --> 00:58:49.300
We have to stop them.

00:58:49.300 --> 00:58:50.420
You and I have to provide support!

00:58:54.220 --> 00:58:55.220
Fate-chan!

00:58:55.760 --> 00:58:58.470
Help me. Let's stop the Jewel Seeds!

00:58:58.470 --> 00:59:00.260
Divide Energy.

00:59:09.280 --> 00:59:10.740
Charging.

00:59:12.320 --> 00:59:13.820
Charging completed.

00:59:15.820 --> 00:59:18.330
Let's split them, we'll each take half!

00:59:30.670 --> 00:59:33.510
Yuuno-kun and Arf-san are
holding them down for us,

00:59:33.510 --> 00:59:38.260
so let's seal them on the count of three!

00:59:38.550 --> 00:59:40.140
Cannon Mode.

00:59:51.150 --> 00:59:54.570
<i>Ah, I think I finally figured it out.</i>

00:59:56.280 --> 00:59:58.410
<i>I know what I want to tell Fate-chan.</i>

00:59:58.410 --> 01:00:01.160
<i>What I want to talk to her about.</i>

01:00:05.000 --> 01:00:07.420
Glaive Form, Set up!

01:00:08.540 --> 01:00:09.920
Bardiche?

01:00:12.590 --> 01:00:14.510
Divine Buster, full power!

01:00:15.010 --> 01:00:17.090
We can seal them away in one blast, right?

01:00:17.090 --> 01:00:18.670
Of course, Master.

01:00:33.360 --> 01:00:34.400
One, two...!

01:00:34.400 --> 01:00:36.070
Thunder...

01:00:38.410 --> 01:00:40.660
Divine...

01:00:46.370 --> 01:00:47.500
...Rage!

01:00:51.790 --> 01:00:53.620
...Buster!

01:01:02.430 --> 01:01:06.560
Amazing! They sealed all
seven of them in one shot!

01:01:07.000 --> 01:01:09.190
Th-That was ridiculous...

01:01:09.190 --> 01:01:10.810
But it was pretty impressive.

01:01:25.450 --> 01:01:29.120
Fate-chan, I finally know
what I wanted to tell you.

01:01:29.710 --> 01:01:33.460
I want to talk to you about lots of things...

01:01:34.050 --> 01:01:35.590
so we can understand each other.

01:01:42.800 --> 01:01:45.470
I want us to be friends.

01:01:56.730 --> 01:01:58.400
Dimensional interference?!

01:01:58.950 --> 01:02:03.410
A high-power magic attack from another
dimension is heading straight for us all!

01:02:03.410 --> 01:02:05.410
Ah! Six seconds until impact!?

01:02:18.580 --> 01:02:19.470
Mother!

01:02:23.930 --> 01:02:24.760
Fate-chan!

01:02:35.310 --> 01:02:39.280
Don't... get in my way!

01:02:43.410 --> 01:02:44.320
Only three?!

01:02:58.130 --> 01:02:59.750
They're escaping! Trace them!

01:03:00.260 --> 01:03:03.510
We can't! Our sensors were
taken offline by that last hit!

01:03:15.860 --> 01:03:18.230
Obeying instructions and orders is a rule

01:03:18.230 --> 01:03:20.570
meant to protect the group as a whole.

01:03:21.110 --> 01:03:24.570
By making independent decisions
and taking independent action,

01:03:25.200 --> 01:03:29.080
you put not just yourselves,
but also the people around you at risk.

01:03:29.080 --> 01:03:31.330
I trust that you understand?

01:03:31.330 --> 01:03:32.080
Yes, ma'am.

01:03:33.040 --> 01:03:36.330
If this were a normal case,
you both could expect severe punishment, but...

01:03:36.330 --> 01:03:40.670
considering the danger posed by the
possibility of the Jewel Seeds fusing,

01:03:40.670 --> 01:03:43.630
I will overlook this one incident.

01:03:44.680 --> 01:03:46.550
This will not happen a second time.

01:03:46.550 --> 01:03:48.260
Yes, ma'am.

01:03:48.260 --> 01:03:50.220
We're sorry.

01:03:50.220 --> 01:03:52.560
Now then... the real problem starts now, huh?

01:03:52.560 --> 01:03:57.360
Chrono, do you have any
clues as to who's behind this?

01:03:57.360 --> 01:03:59.440
Yes. Amy, put it on the monitor.

01:04:00.020 --> 01:04:00.850
Right away!

01:04:04.280 --> 01:04:05.320
Oh, my.

01:04:05.320 --> 01:04:11.200
Right. A mage from our home world
Midchilda, Presea Testarossa.

01:04:11.700 --> 01:04:13.960
And the girl we saw, Fate...

01:04:14.620 --> 01:04:17.460
Fate-chan... Back then, she said "Mother..."

01:04:17.460 --> 01:04:19.460
Her daughter, huh?

01:04:19.960 --> 01:04:25.470
Presea was the head of R&D at a
Midchildan private sector energy venture,

01:04:25.470 --> 01:04:28.970
but she caused an accident and had to retire.

01:04:29.470 --> 01:04:31.470
We still have footage from the trial.

01:04:39.310 --> 01:04:44.320
How could you just stand there when
you had such a golden opportunity?

01:04:44.820 --> 01:04:46.570
I'm... sorry...

01:04:46.570 --> 01:04:48.450
You're too cruel, Fate...

01:04:49.030 --> 01:04:52.320
Are you so intent on filling me with grief?!

01:04:57.500 --> 01:04:59.420
After using magic of that magnitude,

01:04:59.420 --> 01:05:04.420
I doubt that Presea or Fate-chan will
be able to do anything for a while.

01:05:04.420 --> 01:05:07.930
Why don't you two take a break, as well?

01:05:07.930 --> 01:05:08.930
B-But...

01:05:08.930 --> 01:05:12.930
Go spend some time with your family and friends.

01:05:14.390 --> 01:05:15.310
Okay.

01:05:18.100 --> 01:05:20.350
Fate! Fate!

01:05:23.690 --> 01:05:25.070
Fate!

01:05:30.740 --> 01:05:32.580
Only nine...

01:05:33.240 --> 01:05:36.450
I won't be able to make it to
Al-Hazard with just these.

01:05:42.560 --> 01:05:45.000
I don't have much time left...

01:06:17.370 --> 01:06:22.080
You're her mother, aren't you!?
And she's your daughter, right!?

01:06:22.080 --> 01:06:26.050
She tries so hard for you!
She works herself half to death for you!

01:06:26.050 --> 01:06:28.550
How can you do such horrible things to her?!

01:06:39.270 --> 01:06:41.730
You're a nuisance.
Get out of my sight.

01:06:49.530 --> 01:06:51.280
<i>I'm sorry, Fate...</i>

01:06:51.280 --> 01:06:53.780
<i>Just wait a little while...</i>

01:07:02.370 --> 01:07:05.710
Fate. Wake up, Fate!

01:07:05.710 --> 01:07:07.000
Yes, Mother.

01:07:08.130 --> 01:07:11.510
These nine Jewel Seeds you've
managed to collect for me...

01:07:12.260 --> 01:07:14.010
they're not enough.

01:07:14.550 --> 01:07:17.510
Go and bring back more.
For your mother's sake.

01:07:20.140 --> 01:07:22.310
Will you do that for me, Fate?

01:07:25.810 --> 01:07:27.820
Yes, Mother!

01:07:29.780 --> 01:07:30.820
Nanoha-chan!

01:07:30.820 --> 01:07:32.990
Thank goodness, you look well!

01:07:32.990 --> 01:07:35.740
I am. Thanks, Suzuka-chan.

01:07:37.660 --> 01:07:40.950
Arisa-chan, I'm sorry for worrying you.

01:07:42.120 --> 01:07:44.710
Well... I guess it's nice...
to see that you're doing well...

01:07:48.500 --> 01:07:51.460
I see... so you'll have to leave again...

01:07:51.460 --> 01:07:52.460
Yeah.

01:07:52.470 --> 01:07:53.470
It must be tough.

01:07:53.470 --> 01:07:56.340
Yeah, but it'll be okay.

01:07:56.890 --> 01:07:59.680
What about after school? Can you hang out?

01:07:59.680 --> 01:08:01.560
Yeah, no problem!

01:08:01.560 --> 01:08:03.260
Then... how about my house?

01:08:03.260 --> 01:08:05.140
I just got a new video game...

01:08:05.140 --> 01:08:06.350
Really?

01:08:07.660 --> 01:08:11.190
Oh, now that I think of it,
I also took in an injured dog last night.

01:08:11.190 --> 01:08:11.860
A dog?

01:08:12.320 --> 01:08:15.610
Yeah. It's really big, and its fur is kind of orange...

01:08:16.200 --> 01:08:17.860
I haven't seen anything like it before.

01:08:18.320 --> 01:08:21.620
And it has a red gem
right here, on its forehead.

01:08:28.290 --> 01:08:31.000
<i>I knew it was you, Arf-san.</i>

01:08:31.000 --> 01:08:32.130
<i>You, huh?</i>

01:08:32.130 --> 01:08:36.590
<i>How did you get hurt?
Is Fate-chan okay?</i>

01:08:36.590 --> 01:08:38.380
Oh my, is she okay?

01:08:38.850 --> 01:08:40.720
Her injuries might be bothering her.

01:08:40.720 --> 01:08:42.550
Why don't we let her rest?

01:08:42.550 --> 01:08:43.390
Yeah.

01:08:45.230 --> 01:08:47.220
Yuuno, be careful!

01:08:47.900 --> 01:08:50.650
It's okay, Yuuno-kun will be fine.

01:08:51.150 --> 01:08:51.770
<i>Nanoha,</i>

01:08:52.530 --> 01:08:55.570
<i>I'll hear what she has to say, so go on ahead.</i>

01:08:55.570 --> 01:08:56.400
<i>Okay.</i>

01:08:56.400 --> 01:08:58.280
Come on, let's have a snack.

01:08:58.820 --> 01:09:02.910
<i>If you're here, that means
everyone else is watching too, huh?</i>

01:09:02.910 --> 01:09:03.780
<i>Yeah.</i>

01:09:04.330 --> 01:09:07.790
I'm Enforcer Chrono Harlaown,
of the Time-Space Administrative Bureau.

01:09:08.580 --> 01:09:11.790
If you tell us what happened,
we won't harm either of you.

01:09:12.340 --> 01:09:15.470
Tell us about yourself, and your mistress.

01:09:16.470 --> 01:09:18.550
<i>I'll tell you. Everything.</i>

01:09:23.060 --> 01:09:25.060
<i>Nanoha, did you hear all that?</i>

01:09:25.060 --> 01:09:26.810
<i>Yes, I heard everything.</i>

01:09:26.810 --> 01:09:32.070
We're going to make the arrest of Presea Testarossa our primary objective.

01:09:32.070 --> 01:09:35.070
What do you want to do, Takamachi Nanoha?

01:09:36.690 --> 01:09:37.860
<i>I...</i>

01:09:39.950 --> 01:09:42.990
<i>I want to save Fate-chan.</i>

01:09:43.450 --> 01:09:46.540
<i>I told her I wanted us to be friends...</i>

01:09:46.540 --> 01:09:48.250
<i>but she hasn't given me an answer yet.</i>

01:09:49.370 --> 01:09:50.210
I see.

01:09:50.210 --> 01:09:53.090
Arf, are you all right with this?

01:09:53.090 --> 01:09:56.210
<i>Yeah. Nanoha, was it?</i>

01:09:56.800 --> 01:10:00.470
<i>I have no right to ask this, but please...</i>

01:10:00.470 --> 01:10:02.720
<i>save Fate.</i>

01:10:04.850 --> 01:10:07.390
<i>It'll be okay. You can count on me.</i>

01:10:11.310 --> 01:10:12.650
What took you so long, Nanoha?

01:10:13.440 --> 01:10:16.940
Look, we're about to go to the
next area! We were waiting for you.

01:10:16.940 --> 01:10:19.070
Sorry, sorry!

01:10:20.410 --> 01:10:21.320
Take that!

01:10:22.030 --> 01:10:23.450
Alright!

01:10:24.460 --> 01:10:25.070
Here you go.

01:10:25.080 --> 01:10:28.040
This mission to save Fate...
What do you have in mind?

01:10:30.210 --> 01:10:33.110
<i>I have a few ideas about that.</i>

01:11:04.320 --> 01:11:06.330
This place should be fine, right?

01:11:06.330 --> 01:11:08.180
Come out, Fate-chan.

01:11:15.170 --> 01:11:17.670
<i>Fate... let's stop doing all this!</i>

01:11:18.300 --> 01:11:21.550
<i>You can't listen to what that
woman has to say anymore!</i>

01:11:21.550 --> 01:11:24.450
<i>I know that... but even so,</i>

01:11:24.450 --> 01:11:26.260
<i>I'm her daughter!</i>

01:11:28.220 --> 01:11:32.270
You're not ready to give up,
and I want to stop you.

01:11:37.150 --> 01:11:39.730
It's the Jewel Seeds that started all of this.

01:11:39.730 --> 01:11:41.770
Release Jewel Seeds!

01:11:42.700 --> 01:11:44.280
So let's make a bet.

01:11:45.070 --> 01:11:48.330
We each bet all of the Jewel Seeds that we have.

01:11:48.330 --> 01:11:49.280
This is where it starts...

01:11:49.740 --> 01:11:52.080
Where it all starts.

01:11:53.670 --> 01:11:57.260
Everything about us has yet to begin...

01:11:58.040 --> 01:12:03.800
So let's make this our first and final true battle,

01:12:03.800 --> 01:12:06.670
and move forward with who we really are!

01:12:10.470 --> 01:12:12.640
Looks like the battle's underway, huh?

01:12:12.640 --> 01:12:13.310
Yeah.

01:12:14.390 --> 01:12:17.030
How's the combat area holding up?

01:12:17.030 --> 01:12:17.980
Looks fine.

01:12:17.980 --> 01:12:20.440
It's a layered system
used for combat training,

01:12:20.440 --> 01:12:23.900
surrounded by a double set of barriers extending to high altitude.

01:12:23.900 --> 01:12:28.070
No one will find them, and they can completely
lay waste to the area without any problems.

01:12:29.950 --> 01:12:32.040
But I have to say,

01:12:32.040 --> 01:12:35.210
it's a little unusual for you to allow
a gamble like this, Chrono-kun.

01:12:35.210 --> 01:12:38.210
Nanoha winning would be the ideal outcome here,

01:12:38.210 --> 01:12:41.630
but it doesn't really matter which of them wins.

01:12:41.630 --> 01:12:45.050
While Nanoha-chan's buying us
time by fighting Fate-chan,

01:12:45.050 --> 01:12:49.220
I'm preparing to trace her
to find out where she came from.

01:12:49.220 --> 01:12:52.310
We're counting on you. Don't let her get away.

01:12:52.310 --> 01:12:53.980
Roger that!

01:12:53.980 --> 01:12:58.520
But... are you sure we
shouldn't tell Nanoha-chan?

01:12:58.520 --> 01:13:00.730
About Presea Testarossa's family,

01:13:01.400 --> 01:13:02.730
and about the accident?

01:13:03.570 --> 01:13:05.740
It'd be best if she wins this battle...

01:13:05.740 --> 01:13:08.350
Right now, I don't want
Nanoha to have any hesitations.

01:13:14.750 --> 01:13:16.070
Nanoha!

01:13:26.880 --> 01:13:28.250
Photon Lancer!

01:13:31.100 --> 01:13:31.720
Fire!

01:13:41.560 --> 01:13:43.400
Divine Shooter!

01:13:45.360 --> 01:13:46.700
Shoot!

01:13:51.530 --> 01:13:52.490
Scythe Form!

01:13:56.660 --> 01:13:57.700
Shoot!

01:14:14.470 --> 01:14:15.470
Thunder Bullet!

01:14:15.880 --> 01:14:16.570
Fire!

01:14:52.550 --> 01:14:54.800
She is more advanced than you.

01:14:55.380 --> 01:14:57.220
You won't beat her easily.

01:14:58.060 --> 01:15:00.890
We're using all the
"wisdom and tactics" we have.

01:15:01.440 --> 01:15:04.020
We have something up our sleeve too,

01:15:04.020 --> 01:15:09.440
so all we have to do is hit
her with all we've got, right?

01:15:12.030 --> 01:15:13.950
All right, Master.

01:16:17.800 --> 01:16:19.600
If I lose here,

01:16:19.600 --> 01:16:21.100
I won't be able to help Mother.

01:16:27.860 --> 01:16:31.030
Things won't go back
to how they used to be!

01:16:38.410 --> 01:16:41.410
<i>I know I've made you suffer terribly,</i>

01:16:41.950 --> 01:16:46.540
<i>but even now, you are the most precious thing in the world to me.</i>

01:16:48.590 --> 01:16:50.800
<i>You mean more to me than anything.</i>

01:16:52.380 --> 01:16:56.840
Mama, are you going to be working late again?

01:16:56.840 --> 01:16:58.050
I'm sorry.

01:17:01.390 --> 01:17:04.800
<i>You've always been so lonely because of me.</i>

01:17:06.600 --> 01:17:09.810
<i>I thought that if I finished
all that development work,</i>

01:17:09.810 --> 01:17:12.440
<i>we'd be able to spend a
long vacation together.</i>

01:17:13.570 --> 01:17:19.200
<i>I promised you that we'd spend some
time together before you started school.</i>

01:17:19.910 --> 01:17:21.870
Testarossa-kun,

01:17:21.870 --> 01:17:25.410
the test of the new reactor
will take place in ten days.

01:17:25.910 --> 01:17:28.880
Please, not yet! The experiment
was scheduled for next month!

01:17:28.880 --> 01:17:30.340
It's already been decided.

01:17:30.340 --> 01:17:33.510
It's a new model! It could go out of control!

01:17:33.510 --> 01:17:36.260
The main office is sending extra manpower.

01:17:36.260 --> 01:17:40.850
This has already been decided, Testarossa.

01:17:47.350 --> 01:17:49.940
Oh, I'll handle the safety protocols.

01:17:49.940 --> 01:17:54.400
If this test doesn't work,
it's gonna look bad for the company.

01:18:17.800 --> 01:18:19.050
Mama...

01:18:21.800 --> 01:18:24.560
Mama, will you always be working this much?

01:18:24.560 --> 01:18:26.930
We're running a test next week.

01:18:26.930 --> 01:18:30.310
Once that's done, I should be
able to take some time off.

01:18:30.310 --> 01:18:31.440
Really?

01:18:31.440 --> 01:18:32.810
You bet.

01:18:32.810 --> 01:18:34.650
Can we go on a picnic?

01:18:34.650 --> 01:18:37.280
Yeah. We can go anywhere you want.

01:18:37.280 --> 01:18:38.900
You promise?

01:18:39.360 --> 01:18:41.410
I promise.

01:18:58.170 --> 01:19:00.220
<i>I was always thinking of myself,</i>

01:19:00.220 --> 01:19:02.590
<i>and causing trouble for Mother.</i>

01:19:08.310 --> 01:19:11.770
<i>I remember everything that day as clearly as if it were yesterday.</i>

01:19:11.770 --> 01:19:13.770
<i>Right up until the accident.</i>

01:19:22.660 --> 01:19:24.950
<i>There was a flash of light in the distance...</i>

01:19:25.700 --> 01:19:27.290
<i>at the place where Mother worked.</i>

01:19:34.840 --> 01:19:37.630
<i>The next thing I knew, I was waking up,</i>

01:19:37.630 --> 01:19:40.260
<i>with Mother looking down at me, crying.</i>

01:19:40.800 --> 01:19:44.050
<i>She said that I'd been hurt in the accident,</i>

01:19:44.050 --> 01:19:46.560
<i>and had been asleep for a long time.</i>

01:19:51.390 --> 01:19:54.230
Look, this is your room.

01:19:56.230 --> 01:19:59.990
Rest for a while, and when you're better,

01:19:59.990 --> 01:20:02.950
I'll take you on a picnic or
to the amusement park,

01:20:02.950 --> 01:20:05.120
or anywhere you want.

01:20:05.120 --> 01:20:08.240
But aren't you busy with work?

01:20:08.240 --> 01:20:11.500
It's fine. Everything is fine now.

01:20:15.080 --> 01:20:15.990
Mama?

01:20:18.300 --> 01:20:21.420
It's nothing. It's nothing at all.

01:20:21.420 --> 01:20:23.550
Everything is fine, Alicia.

01:20:24.340 --> 01:20:26.550
Alicia...

01:20:27.890 --> 01:20:31.750
How does it taste, Alicia? Is it good?

01:20:31.750 --> 01:20:33.350
That's not my name...

01:20:34.100 --> 01:20:37.560
Mother... my name is Fate.

01:20:37.560 --> 01:20:39.900
You're so adorable,

01:20:39.900 --> 01:20:41.400
Alicia.

01:20:45.530 --> 01:20:47.660
<i>No! It doesn't matter!</i>

01:20:51.160 --> 01:20:52.540
<i>I'll win!</i>

01:20:53.660 --> 01:20:55.330
<i>I'll win, and I'll go back...</i>

01:20:56.250 --> 01:20:57.250
<i>to Mother!</i>

01:21:21.610 --> 01:21:23.780
That's a grounding bind...

01:21:23.780 --> 01:21:25.410
and isn't that...?

01:21:25.410 --> 01:21:26.030
Fate!

01:21:35.160 --> 01:21:36.000
Phalanx...

01:21:40.380 --> 01:21:42.590
Pulverize her!

01:22:07.860 --> 01:22:08.860
Spark...

01:22:11.410 --> 01:22:12.240
End!

01:22:51.650 --> 01:22:53.610
Can you move, Master?

01:22:54.200 --> 01:22:56.790
I'm good to go, Raising Heart.

01:22:56.790 --> 01:22:57.860
Cannon Mode!

01:23:10.110 --> 01:23:10.750
A bind?

01:23:11.790 --> 01:23:12.550
When did she...?

01:23:24.310 --> 01:23:28.100
Divine...

01:23:28.100 --> 01:23:30.480
Buster!

01:23:41.580 --> 01:23:45.120
She should be at her limit, too...

01:23:49.510 --> 01:23:52.170
If I can just get through this...

01:24:35.300 --> 01:24:37.220
Starlight Breaker.

01:24:39.430 --> 01:24:42.720
Collect the unused mana
that we've scattered around,

01:24:43.190 --> 01:24:45.600
and bring it all together.

01:24:47.270 --> 01:24:50.280
It's a focused magical attack...

01:24:53.280 --> 01:24:56.900
This is Raising Heart's "wisdom and tactics,"

01:24:56.900 --> 01:24:58.620
my final ace in the hole!

01:25:02.000 --> 01:25:03.210
Take this!

01:25:04.250 --> 01:25:07.870
This is my full power, at full throttle!

01:25:14.550 --> 01:25:20.340
Starlight Breaker!

01:26:19.570 --> 01:26:20.530
Fate-chan!

01:26:54.780 --> 01:26:56.940
I'm sorry, are you okay?

01:27:01.740 --> 01:27:03.030
Can you move?

01:27:13.000 --> 01:27:16.210
That's enough, Fate.

01:27:16.960 --> 01:27:20.010
I'm done with you!

01:27:26.720 --> 01:27:28.980
I'm detecting high-power magic!

01:27:28.980 --> 01:27:32.060
The wavelength matches Presea Testarossa!

01:27:32.060 --> 01:27:35.230
We have an incoming transdimensional
strike on the combat zone!

01:27:35.860 --> 01:27:37.730
Nanoha-chan, Yuuno-kun...!

01:27:57.550 --> 01:27:59.210
Mother?

01:28:14.060 --> 01:28:16.060
Fate-chan!

01:28:28.200 --> 01:28:30.870
Determining the origin of the mana...!

01:28:30.870 --> 01:28:33.870
Spatial coordinates... confirmed!

01:28:35.040 --> 01:28:36.840
Transfer coordinates set.

01:28:39.840 --> 01:28:42.420
Infiltration unit, move out
through the transfer port.

01:28:43.130 --> 01:28:46.260
Your mission is to take
Presea Testarossa into custody.

01:28:49.880 --> 01:28:51.430
Intruders detected!

01:28:51.430 --> 01:28:54.260
Many intruders now in Garden.

01:29:05.240 --> 01:29:08.560
It's... not over yet...

01:29:10.540 --> 01:29:14.210
I have to keep my promise to her...

01:29:22.070 --> 01:29:22.750
Move out!

01:29:45.400 --> 01:29:46.860
Presea Testarossa,

01:29:46.860 --> 01:29:50.580
for suspicion of violating the law by attacking
a Time-Space Administrative Bureau vessel,

01:29:50.580 --> 01:29:52.070
you will be arrested!

01:30:09.850 --> 01:30:11.460
This is...!

01:30:11.460 --> 01:30:15.350
Don't lay a finger on my Alicia!

01:30:35.160 --> 01:30:37.790
Ali... cia...

01:30:38.960 --> 01:30:44.960
I don't know if we can make it
there with just nine Jewel Seeds...

01:30:46.920 --> 01:30:50.220
but it's all right now.
I'll put an end to everything.

01:30:51.180 --> 01:30:53.660
To all the time I've spent without her...

01:30:54.520 --> 01:30:58.440
and to pretending that doll
I created was my daughter.

01:30:59.490 --> 01:31:01.220
Are you listening?

01:31:01.220 --> 01:31:03.570
I'm talking about you, Fate.

01:31:04.530 --> 01:31:08.150
I went to all the trouble of
giving you Alicia's memories...

01:31:08.150 --> 01:31:11.070
but you're only identical to her on the outside.

01:31:11.070 --> 01:31:16.650
You're useless and utterly
worthless, my little doll.

01:31:16.650 --> 01:31:19.080
During the first incident,

01:31:19.790 --> 01:31:24.580
Presea lost her biological
daughter, Alicia Testarossa.

01:31:27.830 --> 01:31:30.090
There was a meltdown of the magic reactor,

01:31:30.090 --> 01:31:32.180
caused by poor safety management.

01:31:40.810 --> 01:31:43.560
Alicia was caught in the blast.

01:31:45.190 --> 01:31:48.280
Ever since, Presea's research has focused on

01:31:48.280 --> 01:31:52.200
exceeding familiars,
with the creation of artificial life...

01:31:53.620 --> 01:31:57.080
and technology to resurrect the dead.

01:31:57.080 --> 01:32:00.830
The special cloning technology that uses memory transcription,

01:32:00.830 --> 01:32:02.420
Project Fate.

01:32:03.170 --> 01:32:05.920
That's right... That's exactly right...

01:32:06.380 --> 01:32:10.420
But it never brought back what I lost.

01:32:11.380 --> 01:32:14.930
Artificial life is just that. Artificial.

01:32:16.640 --> 01:32:19.890
Alicia's smile was much sweeter than yours.

01:32:20.640 --> 01:32:22.640
Alicia could even be selfish at times,

01:32:22.640 --> 01:32:26.400
but she listened well
to what I told her.

01:32:27.190 --> 01:32:30.990
Alicia was always kind to me.

01:32:35.320 --> 01:32:35.990
Fate,

01:32:36.990 --> 01:32:40.250
you aren't my daughter.

01:32:40.250 --> 01:32:41.960
You're just a failure of mine.

01:32:42.500 --> 01:32:45.880
So, I don't need you anymore.

01:32:45.880 --> 01:32:47.460
Go wherever you want.
Just get out of my sight!

01:32:50.010 --> 01:32:52.970
I'll tell you something good, Fate.

01:32:52.970 --> 01:32:56.390
Ever since I created you...

01:32:56.390 --> 01:32:57.970
every single moment,

01:32:57.970 --> 01:33:00.470
I've despised you.

01:33:09.270 --> 01:33:10.160
Fate-chan!

01:33:10.160 --> 01:33:11.230
Fate...

01:33:11.690 --> 01:33:13.990
Th-This is bad! Look at this,

01:33:14.510 --> 01:33:17.370
I'm detecting many magical
signatures within the compound!

01:33:21.830 --> 01:33:25.000
All magical signatures are rated A class!

01:33:25.000 --> 01:33:29.210
We have sixty... eighty! Still increasing!

01:33:29.210 --> 01:33:32.590
Presea Testarossa, what in
the world are you up to?

01:33:33.880 --> 01:33:36.180
We're setting out on a journey!

01:33:37.090 --> 01:33:41.270
To the eternal capital, Al-Hazard!

01:33:48.810 --> 01:33:53.570
I'm going to use this power
to go there and take it back!

01:33:54.530 --> 01:33:55.810
I'll take it all back!

01:33:59.330 --> 01:34:00.780
It's a dimensional distortion!

01:34:00.780 --> 01:34:01.830
Activate the impact defense!

01:34:01.830 --> 01:34:05.120
The nine Jewel Seeds have
activated and are getting stronger!

01:34:05.710 --> 01:34:07.500
Wave energy has increased significantly!

01:34:07.500 --> 01:34:09.790
It's only a matter of time before it
turns into a dimensional dislocation!

01:34:13.920 --> 01:34:17.090
<i>The forgotten capital, Al-Hazard...</i>

01:34:17.090 --> 01:34:19.550
<i>A place where forbidden technology was developed.</i>

01:34:19.550 --> 01:34:24.060
<i>Is she trying to use its forbidden magic to bring back what she lost?</i>

01:34:30.900 --> 01:34:34.280
No! No! This isn't right!

01:34:35.190 --> 01:34:37.320
The memory transcription
process should have worked fine!

01:34:37.320 --> 01:34:41.780
She has Alicia's memories!

01:34:42.700 --> 01:34:44.080
But it's still all wrong!

01:34:44.080 --> 01:34:46.250
She's not left-handed,
she's better with different magic,

01:34:46.250 --> 01:34:47.290
and her personality's different!

01:34:48.040 --> 01:34:51.330
What went wrong? Why isn't she her?

01:34:56.970 --> 01:35:00.220
<i>This girl isn't Alicia...</i>

01:35:01.050 --> 01:35:02.930
<i>She's just a failure.</i>

01:35:05.310 --> 01:35:09.690
<i>Alicia's body is still perfectly intact.</i>

01:35:10.310 --> 01:35:13.020
<i>She just doesn't have any life in her...</i>

01:35:13.650 --> 01:35:16.640
<i>A way to return the life to her body...</i>

01:35:17.530 --> 01:35:19.270
<i>That's what I have to find.</i>

01:35:20.160 --> 01:35:22.830
<i>I walk a path filled with taboos.</i>

01:35:23.410 --> 01:35:28.120
<i>I'll need a tool I can send out to work for me.</i>

01:35:37.880 --> 01:35:41.720
I've got it...! I've got it!

01:35:42.340 --> 01:35:43.720
All I need to do

01:35:43.720 --> 01:35:48.560
is to raise that girl, that fake,
and use her to do what I need.

01:35:55.980 --> 01:36:00.280
All I have to do is create someone to teach her.

01:36:15.340 --> 01:36:17.760
Good morning, Master.

01:36:17.760 --> 01:36:18.660
Right.

01:36:19.220 --> 01:36:25.470
Umm, I think I was a newborn
kitten or something like that...

01:36:25.470 --> 01:36:29.810
I don't have any memories about myself at all.

01:36:30.480 --> 01:36:32.020
It doesn't matter.

01:36:32.650 --> 01:36:38.530
Familiar Rynith, your job is to raise and look after my daughter.

01:36:39.030 --> 01:36:42.400
Raise her to be the best mage possible.

01:36:47.030 --> 01:36:48.990
Young miss, what's your name?

01:36:51.500 --> 01:36:54.750
I'm Fate. Fate Testarossa.

01:37:01.470 --> 01:37:04.010
How is she doing? How is Fate?

01:37:04.010 --> 01:37:07.470
She's certainly your daughter, Presea.

01:37:07.470 --> 01:37:09.060
With the proper training,

01:37:09.060 --> 01:37:11.310
she will become a mage of the highest caliber.

01:37:11.310 --> 01:37:12.890
There's not much time.

01:37:13.480 --> 01:37:16.730
Raise her such that I can send her into the outside world as soon as possible.

01:37:18.440 --> 01:37:19.360
Presea...

01:37:19.980 --> 01:37:24.860
Are you sure you can't spend
a little more time with her?

01:37:25.490 --> 01:37:28.240
Fate never says as much herself,

01:37:28.240 --> 01:37:30.040
but seeing how much she loves you...

01:37:30.040 --> 01:37:32.080
it's just so sad.

01:37:32.540 --> 01:37:36.330
Don't keep making me repeat myself!
Do as I've ordered you–

01:37:39.670 --> 01:37:40.620
Presea!

01:37:42.970 --> 01:37:45.840
I don't have much time left.

01:37:52.060 --> 01:37:54.140
Rynith, isn't this a...?

01:37:54.850 --> 01:37:59.820
That's right. It's your Device.
Its name is Bardiche.

01:37:59.820 --> 01:38:01.230
It's an axe?

01:38:01.230 --> 01:38:04.240
It's an axe, it's a spear,

01:38:04.240 --> 01:38:07.740
it's even a blade of light that
will slice through everything.

01:38:08.450 --> 01:38:10.580
It's nice to meet you, Bardiche.

01:38:27.840 --> 01:38:29.010
Presea?

01:38:30.890 --> 01:38:33.930
Presea, where are you?

01:38:34.980 --> 01:38:36.190
Presea?

01:38:39.020 --> 01:38:40.230
Presea!

01:38:41.360 --> 01:38:43.980
Presea, are you okay?!

01:38:51.280 --> 01:38:52.330
You saw it, didn't you?

01:38:52.990 --> 01:38:56.000
I saw the research you've been conducting,

01:38:56.000 --> 01:38:59.080
and the technology you've been searching for...

01:39:00.000 --> 01:39:03.050
Presea, no matter how badly we wish for it,

01:39:03.050 --> 01:39:04.960
the dead won't come back.

01:39:05.460 --> 01:39:07.680
That goes for any time you've lost, as well.

01:39:08.260 --> 01:39:10.590
Alicia's accident was a tragedy,

01:39:11.100 --> 01:39:13.970
but here and now, you have Fate to...

01:39:16.350 --> 01:39:19.350
What do you know?!

01:39:19.350 --> 01:39:23.860
What do you know about me and Alicia?!

01:39:24.400 --> 01:39:26.030
I don't know anything.

01:39:26.030 --> 01:39:28.700
You were the one who made me forget!

01:39:28.700 --> 01:39:33.370
But there's one thing that even a
familiar that was born a lynx knows!

01:39:35.950 --> 01:39:38.460
It's still not too late to turn back!

01:39:47.050 --> 01:39:49.300
I was always working...

01:39:50.260 --> 01:39:54.260
I was never able to show
Alicia the love she deserved.

01:39:55.180 --> 01:39:57.220
Once I was done with work,

01:39:57.220 --> 01:39:59.560
once the day I'd promised her finally arrived,

01:39:59.560 --> 01:40:01.850
I had always planned to give Alicia

01:40:02.310 --> 01:40:05.570
all my time and all my love!

01:40:06.230 --> 01:40:08.150
But still...

01:40:08.150 --> 01:40:11.980
I don't have any love to give to that failure!

01:40:11.980 --> 01:40:14.230
There's no way I could!

01:40:14.230 --> 01:40:16.330
There's no way I could...

01:40:19.660 --> 01:40:22.210
Your duties,

01:40:22.210 --> 01:40:24.170
as well as your life as a familiar,

01:40:25.090 --> 01:40:28.050
will end when Fate's training
as a mage is complete.

01:40:31.300 --> 01:40:36.310
Go complete Fate's training, then disappear.

01:40:46.110 --> 01:40:49.070
Dimensional distortion intensity is growing!

01:40:54.450 --> 01:40:56.740
The Garden's reactor is functioning abnormally!

01:40:56.740 --> 01:41:01.250
Is she trying to overload the reactor
to make up for the output she's missing?

01:41:11.920 --> 01:41:15.470
You know what these are, right, Yuuno?
Watch out for those holes.

01:41:15.470 --> 01:41:19.220
It's imaginary space.
Space where magic won't work.

01:41:19.220 --> 01:41:21.390
Flying spells won't work, either.

01:41:21.390 --> 01:41:24.480
If you fall, you'll head straight to the bottom of the gravity well.

01:41:25.520 --> 01:41:26.390
Roger that!

01:41:41.830 --> 01:41:43.370
We'll split into two groups.

01:41:43.370 --> 01:41:46.830
You two seal the reactor on
the top floor of the Garden.

01:41:46.830 --> 01:41:47.880
What about you, Chrono-kun?

01:41:48.420 --> 01:41:50.380
I'm going to stop Presea!

01:41:51.090 --> 01:41:53.250
I'm going to carve a path to her right now!

01:41:53.720 --> 01:41:55.260
I'm heading out, too.

01:41:55.260 --> 01:41:58.010
I'll suppress the dimensional
distortion in the Garden!

01:42:02.810 --> 01:42:07.520
I'm worried about them,
so I'm going to go help out a bit, too.

01:42:10.520 --> 01:42:13.070
I'll be right back, okay?

01:42:26.000 --> 01:42:27.380
<i>Mother...</i>

01:42:29.250 --> 01:42:31.000
<i>never paid any attention to me,</i>

01:42:31.920 --> 01:42:33.660
<i>not even once.</i>

01:42:35.420 --> 01:42:39.350
<i>It was Alicia that she missed, not me.</i>

01:42:40.720 --> 01:42:41.950
<i>I'm nothing but...</i>

01:42:43.350 --> 01:42:45.270
<i>a failure to her.</i>

01:42:46.600 --> 01:42:51.940
<i>Maybe I should never have been born.</i>

01:42:58.910 --> 01:43:02.620
<i>Arf... and that girl...</i>

01:43:03.790 --> 01:43:05.790
<i>What was her name again?</i>

01:43:07.700 --> 01:43:11.340
<i>She made sure I knew...</i>

01:43:14.210 --> 01:43:15.720
<i>We fought again and again.</i>

01:43:17.130 --> 01:43:20.140
<i>I did some terrible things to her, but...</i>

01:43:22.930 --> 01:43:24.310
<i>she still called out to me.</i>

01:43:25.560 --> 01:43:28.810
<i>She called my name.</i>

01:43:31.520 --> 01:43:32.690
<i>Again...</i>

01:43:34.480 --> 01:43:35.610
<i>and again.</i>

01:43:49.120 --> 01:43:50.040
Bardiche.

01:43:50.670 --> 01:43:54.210
My... our story...

01:43:54.210 --> 01:43:56.050
It hasn't even begun yet...

01:44:09.010 --> 01:44:09.930
Get set.

01:44:13.560 --> 01:44:15.440
That's right.

01:44:15.440 --> 01:44:20.200
You've been by my side this
whole time, haven't you, Bardiche?

01:44:21.530 --> 01:44:26.530
You hate the idea of things
ending like this, too, don't you?

01:44:27.200 --> 01:44:28.540
Yes, sir.

01:44:37.590 --> 01:44:40.330
I don't know if we'll be able to pull it off, but...

01:44:40.330 --> 01:44:41.470
let's do our best together, okay?

01:44:50.560 --> 01:44:52.400
Recovery complete.

01:44:53.190 --> 01:44:57.400
We haven't even lived our lives yet.

01:45:03.070 --> 01:45:06.530
So let's work to be true to ourselves...

01:45:08.790 --> 01:45:12.290
and end who we've been so far!

01:45:32.100 --> 01:45:34.600
Damn! They just keep coming and coming!

01:45:45.490 --> 01:45:46.740
Nanoha!

01:45:49.200 --> 01:45:50.750
Thunder Rage.

01:46:01.750 --> 01:46:05.510
Thunder Rage!

01:46:13.390 --> 01:46:14.350
Fate...

01:46:35.290 --> 01:46:37.700
It's a big one. Its defenses will be strong.

01:46:42.630 --> 01:46:44.630
But if we work together...

01:46:47.420 --> 01:46:49.630
Yeah! Yeah! Yeah!

01:47:30.930 --> 01:47:32.080
Bardiche!

01:47:32.080 --> 01:47:33.430
Get set!

01:47:34.430 --> 01:47:36.020
Raising Heart!

01:47:36.020 --> 01:47:37.720
Stand by, Ready!

01:47:42.570 --> 01:47:46.850
Thunder Smasher!

01:47:50.570 --> 01:47:54.780
Divine Buster!

01:47:58.790 --> 01:48:01.380
One, two...!

01:48:23.400 --> 01:48:24.520
Fate-chan...

01:48:28.610 --> 01:48:31.530
Fate! Fate!

01:48:34.120 --> 01:48:35.030
Arf...

01:48:35.030 --> 01:48:37.400
I'm sorry for worrying you.

01:48:52.340 --> 01:48:55.100
Just a little more...

01:48:57.470 --> 01:48:59.390
Presea Testarossa.

01:49:00.600 --> 01:49:04.560
It's over. I'm suppressing
the dimensional distortion.

01:49:05.230 --> 01:49:07.470
The reactor should be sealed momentarily.

01:49:07.470 --> 01:49:10.400
My Enforcer is currently heading to your position.

01:49:11.150 --> 01:49:13.870
The forgotten capital, Al-Hazard...

01:49:13.870 --> 01:49:16.100
The secrets that lie there...

01:49:16.100 --> 01:49:20.160
All of that should have been lost long ago!

01:49:20.660 --> 01:49:24.880
You're wrong. Al-Hazard still exists.

01:49:24.880 --> 01:49:28.930
The path should lie in the
interstice between dimensions.

01:49:30.130 --> 01:49:32.660
Even if that were true,

01:49:32.660 --> 01:49:35.350
what would you do there?

01:49:37.810 --> 01:49:39.180
I'll get her back.

01:49:39.680 --> 01:49:42.900
I'll take back my and Alicia's past and future.

01:49:44.060 --> 01:49:45.230
I'll take it back...

01:49:46.120 --> 01:49:50.050
everything that went wrong in this world!

01:49:55.910 --> 01:49:57.660
Don't ignore reality!

01:49:58.280 --> 01:50:02.710
No matter what spell you cast,
you can't regain the past!

01:50:18.550 --> 01:50:19.390
Mother!

01:50:20.930 --> 01:50:22.810
What did <i>you</i> come here for?

01:50:24.690 --> 01:50:26.160
Get out of my sight.

01:50:26.160 --> 01:50:28.440
You're of no more use to me.

01:50:30.320 --> 01:50:33.950
I have something I want to say to you.

01:50:37.530 --> 01:50:43.870
Maybe it's true that I'm just a failure and a fake.

01:50:44.620 --> 01:50:48.390
I'm sorry that I couldn't be Alicia
or live up to your expectations.

01:50:50.170 --> 01:50:53.420
If you want me to leave,
I'll go somewhere far away,

01:50:54.310 --> 01:50:57.430
but ever since you made me,
I've always wanted you...

01:50:57.430 --> 01:51:01.430
and I still do...

01:51:01.890 --> 01:51:04.170
I want to make you smile, Mother.

01:51:04.170 --> 01:51:08.380
If nothing else, my desire
to make you happy is real.

01:51:12.570 --> 01:51:17.900
These are my real feelings.
The feelings of Fate Testarossa.

01:51:21.410 --> 01:51:23.660
Ridiculous.

01:51:39.140 --> 01:51:42.380
Captain, it's no use!
The Garden is falling apart!

01:51:43.110 --> 01:51:45.100
Chrono-kun, you and the others have to escape.

01:51:45.100 --> 01:51:47.690
There's not much time before
it completely collapses!

01:51:47.690 --> 01:51:48.980
Roger that!

01:51:49.560 --> 01:51:50.850
Fate Testarossa!

01:51:51.180 --> 01:51:52.100
Fate!

01:51:56.780 --> 01:51:59.990
I'm going. Together with Alicia.

01:52:01.450 --> 01:52:02.990
Mother...

01:52:03.450 --> 01:52:05.080
Don't you remember?

01:52:05.080 --> 01:52:08.410
I told you that I despise you.

01:52:10.790 --> 01:52:12.710
Mother! Alicia!

01:52:21.300 --> 01:52:22.680
Alicia...

01:52:26.070 --> 01:52:31.010
Alicia, is there anything
you want for your birthday?

01:52:31.480 --> 01:52:36.400
Umm... I know! I want a little sister!

01:52:37.990 --> 01:52:41.660
If I had a sister, I wouldn't be
so lonely when you're gone,

01:52:41.660 --> 01:52:44.700
and she'd be able to help you out a lot!

01:52:44.700 --> 01:52:46.830
Well, that's true, but...

01:52:46.830 --> 01:52:50.330
I want a sister. Mama, promise me.

01:52:55.380 --> 01:52:59.880
<i>I've always been this way, haven't I?</i>

01:53:00.380 --> 01:53:03.550
<i>I never notice things until it's too late.</i>

01:53:09.180 --> 01:53:11.890
Alicia... Mother!

01:53:11.890 --> 01:53:13.060
Fate!

01:53:24.490 --> 01:53:26.280
Fate-chan! Chrono-kun!

01:53:29.000 --> 01:53:31.540
We're getting out of here!
Amy! We need an exit!

01:53:31.540 --> 01:53:33.120
Roger that!

01:53:40.720 --> 01:53:42.680
The Garden has collapsed.

01:53:42.680 --> 01:53:46.600
Confirming recovery of the mages
starting with Enforcer Chrono.

01:53:46.600 --> 01:53:48.310
We have them all!

01:53:48.310 --> 01:53:52.850
Dimensional distortion has stopped.
No signs of a dislocation occurring!

01:53:53.390 --> 01:53:55.230
Roger that.

01:54:01.110 --> 01:54:02.200
Chrono-kun.

01:54:02.780 --> 01:54:04.240
Is something the matter?

01:54:04.240 --> 01:54:06.200
What about Fate-chan and Arf-san?

01:54:07.370 --> 01:54:12.080
I'm sorry, but they were major
participants in this case.

01:54:12.750 --> 01:54:15.750
We currently have them confined to quarters.

01:54:15.750 --> 01:54:17.460
We can't allow you to see them.

01:54:17.460 --> 01:54:22.580
In any case, it won't be like
this forever, so just be patient.

01:54:22.580 --> 01:54:23.480
Okay?

01:54:25.930 --> 01:54:27.100
Okay.

01:54:38.480 --> 01:54:40.730
I brought you some dinner.

01:54:41.350 --> 01:54:42.730
Let's eat together.

01:54:45.240 --> 01:54:48.450
Fate is a key figure in this case.

01:54:48.450 --> 01:54:51.540
I doubt she's going to be acquitted.

01:54:51.540 --> 01:54:54.540
However, she didn't know the truth.

01:54:55.040 --> 01:54:59.460
It might sound harsh,
but she was just being used as a tool.

01:54:59.460 --> 01:55:01.250
Extenuating circumstances
may be taken into account.

01:55:01.250 --> 01:55:05.620
At the very least, we'll try to
get her a suspended sentence.

01:55:07.590 --> 01:55:09.760
Thank you, Chrono-kun.

01:55:09.760 --> 01:55:15.020
The thing is, trials like these can drag on forever.

01:55:17.850 --> 01:55:20.900
That's right. Six months at the very least.

01:55:20.900 --> 01:55:23.780
But they can last two or three years, or longer.

01:55:23.780 --> 01:55:27.360
Still, if you behave yourselves
during that time under the care

01:55:27.360 --> 01:55:30.950
of your legal guardian, you'll be able to lead fairly normal lives.

01:55:30.950 --> 01:55:32.660
Legal guardian? Who?

01:55:32.660 --> 01:55:34.830
That'd be me.

01:55:34.830 --> 01:55:39.920
Captain of the Arthra, Lindy Harlaown!
I am now your legal guardian.

01:55:39.920 --> 01:55:43.090
Let's get along, Fate-san, Arf!

01:55:45.760 --> 01:55:50.460
And so, the Jewel Seed
incident started to wrap up.

01:56:06.990 --> 01:56:09.820
But there was one thing...

01:56:12.660 --> 01:56:14.240
still on my mind...

01:56:15.250 --> 01:56:19.750
The girl with the beautiful eyes...
who looked so gentle.

01:56:37.930 --> 01:56:39.270
Yes? Hello?

01:56:39.270 --> 01:56:43.530
Oh, Nanoha-san? Sorry for
calling you so early in the morning.

01:56:43.530 --> 01:56:44.310
That's okay.

01:56:44.770 --> 01:56:50.070
Fate-san will be going to HQ for her trial next week.

01:56:50.070 --> 01:56:50.820
I see.

01:56:50.820 --> 01:56:54.320
And I was thinking if you had some time...

01:56:55.080 --> 01:56:57.830
Right. Right. Right!

01:56:58.290 --> 01:56:59.610
I'll be right there.

01:57:00.460 --> 01:57:02.580
Nanoha, what's up?

01:57:02.580 --> 01:57:05.380
She said I'd be able to see
Fate-chan for a few minutes!

01:57:05.380 --> 01:57:06.880
Really?

01:57:08.550 --> 01:57:12.500
She even wants to see me, too!

01:57:35.990 --> 01:57:37.570
Fate-chan!

01:57:48.210 --> 01:57:50.000
We'll be waiting over there.

01:57:51.030 --> 01:57:52.760
Sure, thanks.

01:57:53.930 --> 01:57:55.390
Thank you.

01:58:17.100 --> 01:58:21.120
There was so much that I wanted to
talk to you about, but it's funny...

01:58:21.120 --> 01:58:24.500
as soon as I saw your face, I completely
forgot everything I was going to say.

01:58:25.330 --> 01:58:26.570
I...

01:58:26.570 --> 01:58:28.250
You're right.

01:58:28.250 --> 01:58:31.550
I can't get the right words out, either.

01:58:32.760 --> 01:58:35.040
But, I was happy...

01:58:36.850 --> 01:58:39.340
that you faced me with such honesty...

01:58:39.350 --> 01:58:43.630
Yeah, I thought it'd be nice
if we could become friends.

01:58:44.320 --> 01:58:48.610
But, you'll be leaving today, right?

01:58:50.320 --> 01:58:53.980
I suppose so. It's going to be a long trip.

01:58:53.990 --> 01:58:56.740
I'll be able to see you again, right?

01:59:01.200 --> 01:59:03.200
It makes me a little sad,

01:59:03.200 --> 01:59:05.540
but this will finally let me
start being my true self.

01:59:08.210 --> 01:59:11.170
I asked you to come so that
I could give you an answer.

01:59:14.220 --> 01:59:16.800
To those words you said to me...

01:59:16.800 --> 01:59:18.950
"I want us to be friends."

01:59:19.430 --> 01:59:20.920
Yeah, yeah!

01:59:21.430 --> 01:59:25.380
I thought if I could...
If it would be all right with you...

01:59:26.350 --> 01:59:29.650
But, I... don't know how to do it.

01:59:30.320 --> 01:59:35.030
That's why I want you to tell me...
how do we become friends?

01:59:39.490 --> 01:59:40.740
It's easy.

01:59:42.740 --> 01:59:45.790
Becoming friends with someone is really easy.

01:59:49.080 --> 01:59:50.790
You just have to call out their name.

01:59:51.880 --> 01:59:54.420
That's all you have to do at first.

01:59:54.420 --> 01:59:58.090
Don't say "Hey, you" or
call them "that person,"

01:59:58.090 --> 02:00:02.600
but look them straight in the
eyes and call them by their name.

02:00:03.470 --> 02:00:05.930
I'm Takamachi Nanoha.

02:00:06.560 --> 02:00:07.890
Call me Nanoha.

02:00:08.850 --> 02:00:09.980
Nanoha...?

02:00:09.980 --> 02:00:11.310
Yeah! Just like that!

02:00:12.770 --> 02:00:13.940
Nanoha...

02:00:14.350 --> 02:00:15.430
Yeah!

02:00:16.610 --> 02:00:17.490
Nanoha.

02:00:18.310 --> 02:00:19.270
Yeah!

02:00:25.000 --> 02:00:27.250
Thank you, Nanoha.

02:00:27.740 --> 02:00:28.700
Yeah...!

02:00:30.630 --> 02:00:31.500
Nanoha.

02:00:35.760 --> 02:00:36.920
Yeah!

02:00:38.170 --> 02:00:41.180
You have warm hands... Nanoha.

02:00:48.310 --> 02:00:50.350
I think I understand something now...

02:00:51.150 --> 02:00:55.940
When you see a friend crying,
you feel the same sadness.

02:00:56.610 --> 02:00:57.990
Fate-chan!

02:00:58.990 --> 02:01:01.030
Thank you, Nanoha...

02:01:01.030 --> 02:01:04.740
I have to leave you for now, but...
I'm sure we'll meet again.

02:01:04.740 --> 02:01:08.160
When we do... is it all right
if I call your name again?

02:01:08.650 --> 02:01:10.160
Yeah. Yeah!

02:01:11.500 --> 02:01:14.380
When I want to see you...
I'll be sure to call out your name.

02:01:17.210 --> 02:01:20.430
So... please call out my name, too.

02:01:21.220 --> 02:01:28.350
Next time when you're the one in trouble,
I'm sure I'll be the one to save you...

02:01:40.110 --> 02:01:46.030
That girl... Nanoha...
is really such a good girl, isn't she?

02:01:47.160 --> 02:01:50.040
Fate's smiling so much...

02:02:02.760 --> 02:02:05.220
It's time. Are you ready to go?

02:02:06.220 --> 02:02:07.310
Fate-chan!

02:02:15.230 --> 02:02:18.940
It's not much to remember
me by, but it's all I have.

02:02:19.400 --> 02:02:20.870
Then, I'll give you mine, too...

02:02:30.580 --> 02:02:32.650
Thank you, Nanoha.

02:02:32.650 --> 02:02:34.920
Yeah, Fate-chan!

02:02:35.460 --> 02:02:36.750
I'm sure we'll meet again.

02:02:37.250 --> 02:02:39.250
Yeah, I'm sure we will!

02:02:45.050 --> 02:02:47.970
Thank you. Arf-san, stay well, okay?

02:02:47.970 --> 02:02:51.430
Yeah. Thanks for everything
you did, Nanoha, Yuuno.

02:02:51.980 --> 02:02:53.600
I should say goodbye, too.

02:02:53.600 --> 02:02:55.270
See you again, Chrono-kun.

02:02:55.270 --> 02:02:55.940
Sure.

02:03:05.450 --> 02:03:07.700
Bye-bye. Until we meet again.

02:03:07.700 --> 02:03:09.450
Chrono-kun...

02:03:10.830 --> 02:03:12.120
Arf-san...

02:03:13.460 --> 02:03:14.620
Fate-chan...

02:03:50.490 --> 02:03:51.620
Nanoha?

02:03:54.200 --> 02:03:56.540
Yeah, I'm fine.

02:03:56.540 --> 02:03:59.420
I know we'll be seeing each other again soon.
